{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T01:42:20.922+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_df86c7d8-f3e6-49dd-917b-32a4f6cff067", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently. A parent is sufficient only if it directly supports that task.\n\n        User Request: how to open an account, and i lost my credit card, and i want to buy a stock\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Long-Term Conversation Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session (latest 10 turns):\nUser: What are the eligibility criteria for Horizon Bank credit cards?\nAI: Eligibility criteria for a Horizon Bank credit card are:\nSingaporean citizens or permanent residents aged between 21 and 55 must have an annual income of at least S$30,000.\nForeigners holding a valid work pass must have an annual income of S$60,000.\nApplicants older than 55 years must meet an annual income of S$15,000 if they are Singaporean citizens or permanent residents.\nApplicants older than 55 years must meet an annual income of S$60,000 if they are foreigners with a valid work pass.\nUser: who r u\nAI: I'm Horizon, Horizon Bank's virtual assistant. I’m here to help with any banking‑related questions you might have. How can I assist you today?\nUser: how to open an account\nAI: Check that you are a Singapore resident, as Horizon Bank only accepts account applications from within Singapore.\n\nHave a mobile phone ready and use MyInfo to auto‑populate the application; you will need to authenticate via SingPass during registration.\n\nSubmit the application through the Horizon app; the initial submission takes a few minutes, and if further clarification is required the process may take up to five business days.\nUser: how to open an account, and i lost my credit card, and i want to buy a stock\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"submit application, use MyInfo, register, Horizon App\", \"policy\": \"Singapore resident requirements\", \"conceptual\": \"account opening, Horizon Bank\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Application\", \"Eligibility\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_70aebcd6\", \"content\": \"Question: What information and tools are necessary to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_586ee40c\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical time required to complete a Horizon Bank application?\\n\\nAnswer: - The submission usually takes only a few minutes.\\n- If further clarification is needed and we must contact you, the process may extend to a maximum of five business days.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b70c251f\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it possible to open a Horizon Bank account through the Horizon App while I am abroad?\\n\\nAnswer: - At present, Horizon Bank does not permit account applications from outside Singapore. You must be a Singapore resident and submit the request locally.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"report lost, card replacement, physical handling, activation\", \"policy\": \"security policy, card protection\", \"conceptual\": \"lost credit card, card logistics\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Card Logistics\", \"Authentication And Security\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ed9b5ce2\", \"content\": \"Question: What measures does Horizon Bank take to protect me from phishing scams and unauthorized transactions?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we prioritize your security and adhere to the guidelines outlined in Section {{faq_ed9b5ce2_001}} of the E-Payments User Protection Guidelines. As part of our commitment to the Shared Responsibility Framework, we have implemented several key measures to safeguard your accounts. These include: \\n   - A mandatory {{faq_ed9b5ce2_002}}-hour waiting period after activating your Horizon Key or logging in from a new device, during which certain high-risk activities such as adding new payees, increasing transaction limits, disabling notifications, or changing your contact information are restricted.\\n   - Immediate notifications: You will receive instant updates via push notifications and email for all outgoing payments, ensuring you are always informed about your transactions.\\n   - Emergency Lockdown: The Horizon App features an Emergency Lockdown option, accessible under Profile > Security, which allows you to instantly block all access to your mobile banking, account, and cards if you suspect they have been compromised.\\n   - Advanced Security Systems: As of {{faq_ed9b5ce2_003}} June {{faq_ed9b5ce2_004}}, we have enhanced our systems to provide an additional layer of protection against potential phishing scams. Some transactions may be temporarily paused for review, and you will be notified to verify the transaction. If you do not recognize the transaction, please cancel it within the {{faq_ed9b5ce2_005}}-hour timeframe provided.\\n   - Round-the-Clock Support: Our customer service is available {{faq_ed9b5ce2_006}}/{{faq_ed9b5ce2_007}}. You can reach us through the Horizon App or by calling our dedicated hotline at +{{faq_ed9b5ce2_008}} {{faq_ed9b5ce2_009}} {{faq_ed9b5ce2_010}} for immediate assistance.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_04a55dce\", \"content\": \"Question: I've noticed that my Horizon card doesn't display any sensitive information - is this a standard feature?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we prioritize your security. To minimize the risk of card fraud and theft, we've intentionally omitted the card number, CVV, and expiry date from the physical card. To access your card details securely, navigate to the Horizon App and follow these steps: \\n   * Select the 'Money' tab\\n   * Choose 'View and manage card'\\n   * Click on 'Card Details' to view your information\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"buy stock, trade, invest\", \"policy\": \"trading rules, fees\", \"conceptual\": \"stocks, wealth management\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"Wealth And Insurance\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_502da680\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the initial steps to begin buying and selling securities with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate trading activities, it is necessary to establish a securities trading account. This can be accomplished by navigating to the Horizon App, selecting the Investments option, and then choosing the Stocks feature. Upon doing so, adhere to the on-screen prompts to finalize the account setup. Please be aware that the approval to open this account is contingent upon an internal evaluation conducted by Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_4bd34aa4\", \"content\": \"Question: At Horizon Bank, what is the lowest investment threshold for purchasing securities?\\n\\nAnswer: With Horizon Bank, you have the flexibility to initiate your investment portfolio by buying stocks and ETFs with a minimum investment of just USD {{faq_4bd34aa4_001}}.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_c8d61dc6\", \"content\": \"Question: What investment opportunities are available through Horizon Bank's stock trading services?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b8e22edc\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank's fee structure work for investment transactions?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we provide a competitive fee environment for our investors. Until December {{faq_b8e22edc_001}}, {{faq_b8e22edc_002}}, trading US stocks and ETFs is commission-free. After this period, a commission of {{faq_b8e22edc_003}} applies, with a minimum charge of USD {{faq_b8e22edc_004}} per trade. For UK UCITS ETFs, a commission rate of {{faq_b8e22edc_005}} is applicable, with a minimum fee of USD {{faq_b8e22edc_006}} per trade. Additionally, a {{faq_b8e22edc_007}} GST is levied on commissions, and your Trade Confirmation will also serve as your Tax Invoice. Notably, Horizon Bank does not impose platform, custody, settlement, or corporate action handling fees. For a detailed breakdown, please navigate to the Horizon App, select your Profile, and then access the Legal section to view the Stocks Fee Schedule.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Return one result for every supplied task_id.\n        - For SUFFICIENT, return only parent IDs from that exact task that are directly relevant. At least one approved ID is required.\n        - For RETRY, return no approved IDs and concise query-refinement feedback. The backend determines terminal UNAVAILABLE status after three failed attempts.\n        - Treat {placeholders} in parent content as valid approved facts.\n        - Never invent a parent ID, fact, or instruction.\n\n        Output JSON only: {\"task_results\": [{\"task_id\": \"...\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\" | \"RETRY\" | \"UNAVAILABLE\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"...\"], \"reason\": \"...\", \"search_feedback\": \"...\"}]}\n        "}
