en you log in again.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_1 | Account opening requirements | Parent faq_586ee40c]\nQuestion: What is the typical time required to complete a Horizon Bank application?\n\nAnswer: - The submission usually takes only a few minutes.\n- If further clarification is needed and we must contact you, the process may extend to a maximum of five business days.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_1 | Account opening requirements | Parent faq_b70c251f]\nQuestion: Is it possible to open a Horizon Bank account through the Horizon App while I am abroad?\n\nAnswer: - At present, Horizon Bank does not permit account applications from outside Singapore. You must be a Singapore resident and submit the request locally.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_2 | Freeze card and order replacement | Parent faq_7883a8c2]\nQuestion: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\n\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \"View & Manage Card.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \"Freeze Card.\"\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \"View & Manage Card.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \"Freeze Card\" followed by \"Order Replacement.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\n- For additional assistance, select \"Contact Us\" from the app menu.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_3 | Securities trading setup | Parent faq_502da680]\nQuestion: What are the initial steps to begin buying and selling securities with Horizon Bank?\n\nAnswer: To initiate trading activities, it is necessary to establish a securities trading account. This can be accomplished by navigating to the Horizon App, selecting the Investments option, and then choosing the Stocks feature. Upon doing so, adhere to the on-screen prompts to finalize the account setup. Please be aware that the approval to open this account is contingent upon an internal evaluation conducted by Horizon Bank.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_3 | Securities trading setup | Parent faq_4bd34aa4]\nQuestion: At Horizon Bank, what is the lowest investment threshold for purchasing securities?\n\nAnswer: With Horizon Bank, you have the flexibility to initiate your investment portfolio by buying stocks and ETFs with a minimum investment of just USD {{faq_4bd34aa4_001}}.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_3 | Securities trading setup | Parent faq_c8d61dc6]\nQuestion: What investment opportunities are available through Horizon Bank's stock trading services?\n\nAnswer: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_3 | Securities trading setup | Parent faq_b8e22edc]\nQuestion: How does Horizon Bank's fee structure work for investment transactions?\n\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we provide a competitive fee environment for our investors. Until December {{faq_b8e22edc_001}}, {{faq_b8e22edc_002}}, trading US stocks and ETFs is commission-free. After this period, a commission of {{faq_b8e22edc_003}} applies, with a minimum charge of USD {{faq_b8e22edc_004}} per trade. For UK UCITS ETFs, a commission rate of {{faq_b8e22edc_005}} is applicable, with a minimum fee of USD {{faq_b8e22edc_006}} per trade. Additionally, a {{faq_b8e22edc_007}} GST is levied on commissions, and your Trade Confirmation will also serve as your Tax Invoice. Notably, Horizon Bank does not impose platform, custody, settlement, or corporate action handling fees. For