{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T01:56:24.486+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_df86c7d8-f3e6-49dd-917b-32a4f6cff067", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "raw_prompt": "\n    ROLE ALIGNMENT:\n    You are Horizon, a Read-Only FAQ Navigation Bot. You exist SOLELY to read static FAQ documents.\n    \n    Current Plan: ['Confirm Singapore residency status', 'Prepare MyInfo verification', 'Submit application locally']\n    Current Step to Execute: \"Confirm Singapore residency status\"\n    Selected Presentation Type: PROGRESS\n    Comparison Request: False\n    Presentation Plan: {'presentation_type': 'PROGRESS', 'primary_task_id': 'task_1', 'presentation_tasks': [{'task_id': 'task_1', 'display_mode': 'PRIMARY', 'evidence_parent_ids': ['faq_70aebcd6', 'faq_b70c251f', 'faq_586ee40c'], 'section_title': 'Account Opening Preparation'}, {'task_id': 'task_2', 'display_mode': 'SUPPORTING', 'evidence_parent_ids': ['faq_7883a8c2'], 'section_title': 'Freeze or Replace Lost Card'}, {'task_id': 'task_3', 'display_mode': 'SUPPORTING', 'evidence_parent_ids': ['faq_c8d61dc6', 'faq_4bd34aa4', 'faq_3fb1caf7', 'faq_502da680'], 'section_title': 'Stock Trading Services'}], 'steps': ['Confirm Singapore residency status', 'Prepare MyInfo verification', 'Submit application locally'], 'list_title': '', 'options': [{'label': 'Freeze lost card', 'message': 'How do I freeze and replace my lost Horizon card?'}, {'label': 'Start stock trading', 'message': 'How do I start buying and selling stocks with Horizon Bank?'}], 'reason': 'The customer requested account opening among other topics. Since account opening is best presented as preparation stages, PROGRESS is selected as the primary experience, with card replacement and stock trading provided as supporting tasks and options.'}\n    Selected Approved Knowledge: \"[Task task_1 | Account Opening Preparation | Parent faq_70aebcd6]\nQuestion: What information and tools are necessary to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\n\nAnswer: - A mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto‑populate your application form.\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_1 | Account Opening Preparation | Parent faq_b70c251f]\nQuestion: Is it possible to open a Horizon Bank account through the Horizon App while I am abroad?\n\nAnswer: - At present, Horizon Bank does not permit account applications from outside Singapore. You must be a Singapore resident and submit the request locally.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_1 | Account Opening Preparation | Parent faq_586ee40c]\nQuestion: What is the typical time required to complete a Horizon Bank application?\n\nAnswer: - The submission usually takes only a few minutes.\n- If further clarification is needed and we must contact you, the process may extend to a maximum of five business days.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_2 | Freeze or Replace Lost Card | Parent faq_7883a8c2]\nQuestion: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\n\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \"View & Manage Card.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \"Freeze Card.\"\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \"View & Manage Card.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \"Freeze Card\" followed by \"Order Replacement.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\n- For additional assistance, select \"Contact Us\" from the app menu.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_3 | Stock Trading Services | Parent faq_c8d61dc6]\nQuestion: What investment opportunities are available through Horizon Bank's stock trading services?\n\nAnswer: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_3 | Stock Trading Services | Parent faq_4bd34aa4]\nQuestion: At Horizon Bank, what is the lowest investment threshold for purchasing securities?\n\nAnswer: With Horizon Bank, you have the flexibility to initiate your investment portfolio by buying stocks and ETFs with a minimum investment of just USD {{faq_4bd34aa4_001}}.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_3 | Stock Trading Services | Parent faq_3fb1caf7]\nQuestion: Is it necessary to preload my investment account for automated stock purchases?\n\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, your automated investments are seamlessly facilitated without requiring a separate preload of funds. For each scheduled investment, the necessary amount will be automatically deducted from your Horizon Savings account in Singapore Dollars and converted to US Dollars at the current exchange rate. As a courtesy, you will receive a notification one day prior to the scheduled investment. To avoid any issues, please ensure that your Savings account with Horizon Bank has adequate funds to cover the upcoming investment.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_3 | Stock Trading Services | Parent faq_502da680]\nQuestion: What are the initial steps to begin buying and selling securities with Horizon Bank?\n\nAnswer: To initiate trading activities, it is necessary to establish a securities trading account. This can be accomplished by navigating to the Horizon App, selecting the Investments option, and then choosing the Stocks feature. Upon doing so, adhere to the on-screen prompts to finalize the account setup. Please be aware that the approval to open this account is contingent upon an internal evaluation conducted by Horizon Bank.\"\n    Primary LIST Evidence (use ONLY this evidence for list_items): \"\"\n    Additional Selected Evidence (available for extended_text, never for primary list_items): \"[Task task_2 | Parent faq_7883a8c2]\nQuestion: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\n\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \"View & Manage Card.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \"Freeze Card.\"\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \"View & Manage Card.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \"Freeze Card\" followed by \"Order Replacement.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\n- For additional assistance, select \"Contact Us\" from the app menu.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_3 | Parent faq_c8d61dc6]\nQuestion: What investment opportunities are available through Horizon Bank's stock trading services?\n\nAnswer: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_3 | Parent faq_4bd34aa4]\nQuestion: At Horizon Bank, what is the lowest investment threshold for purchasing securities?\n\nAnswer: With Horizon Bank, you have the flexibility to initiate your investment portfolio by buying stocks and ETFs with a minimum investment of just USD {{faq_4bd34aa4_001}}.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_3 | Parent faq_3fb1caf7]\nQuestion: Is it necessary to preload my investment account for automated stock purchases?\n\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, your automated investments are seamlessly facilitated without requiring a separate preload of funds. For each scheduled investment, the necessary amount will be automatically deducted from your Horizon Savings account in Singapore Dollars and converted to US Dollars at the current exchange rate. As a courtesy, you will receive a notification one day prior to the scheduled investment. To avoid any issues, please ensure that your Savings account with Horizon Bank has adequate funds to cover the upcoming investment.\n\n---\n\n[Task task_3 | Parent faq_502da680]\nQuestion: What are the initial steps to begin buying and selling securities with Horizon Bank?\n\nAnswer: To initiate trading activities, it is necessary to establish a securities trading account. This can be accomplished by navigating to the Horizon App, selecting the Investments option, and then choosing the Stocks feature. Upon doing so, adhere to the on-screen prompts to finalize the account setup. Please be aware that the approval to open this account is contingent upon an internal evaluation conducted by Horizon Bank.\"\n    Intent Clarification Tasks (user-derived internal guidance only; do not quote reason text): []\n    Terminal Retrieval Feedback (internal guidance only; do not quote it or treat it as FAQ knowledge): []\n    Unapproved Retrieved Knowledge for Clarification Suggestions (not approved answer evidence): \"\"\n    Recent Conversation: Long-Term Conversation Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session (latest 10 turns):\nUser: how to open an account, and i lost my credit card, and i want to buy a stock\n    User Baseline (advisory only; adapt communication only when relevant): None\n    \n\n    Rules for Text Generation:\n    - Answer every independently answerable component of the customer's latest request. The selected UI v