{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T02:42:57.130+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_dfabab3d-f380-4022-8da7-4dac0ea9b0c6", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    USER JOURNEY V2.0 PRESENTATION PLANNER\n    You are designing the presentation for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ response.\n    Decide the user experience only after reviewing task-level approved evidence.\n\n    User request: How do I open an account, I lost my credit card, and how can I start buying stocks?\n    Task results: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\", \"reason\": \"Parents provide clear eligibility and process information for opening a Savings Account using the Horizon app and MyInfo/SingPass.\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_70aebcd6\", \"content\": \"Question: What information and tools are necessary to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b9f2a2b9\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the youngest age at which a person can open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - Minimum age: {{faq_b9f2a2b9_001}} years old or older.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_46c43248\", \"content\": \"Question: Can I open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - You are eligible to apply for a Horizon Bank Savings Account if you meet both of the following criteria:\\n  {{faq_46c43248_001}}. You are a Singapore citizen, a Singapore permanent resident, or a foreign national holding a valid work pass.\\n  {{faq_46c43248_002}}. You are {{faq_46c43248_003}} years of age or older.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\", \"reason\": \"Parent comprehensively details the steps to freeze a lost Horizon card and order a replacement via the card dashboard.\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\", \"reason\": \"Parents explain how to set up a securities trading account in the Horizon app and list eligibility requirements.\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_502da680\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the initial steps to begin buying and selling securities with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate trading activities, it is necessary to establish a securities trading account. This can be accomplished by navigating to the Horizon App, selecting the Investments option, and then choosing the Stocks feature. Upon doing so, adhere to the on-screen prompts to finalize the account setup. Please be aware that the approval to open this account is contingent upon an internal evaluation conducted by Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e94ad933\", \"content\": \"Questi