emporarily block the card, or choose “Order Replacement” to request a new card.\n\n\nUser: shall we go to eat mcdonalds?\nAI: I'm sorry, but I can only help with Horizon Bank related questions. Let me know if you have any banking queries.\n\nDo you have a banking question I can assist you with?\nUser: why my debit card become credit card?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Horizon App, account conversion, card type check, settings update\", \"policy\": \"card type rules, conversion policy, feature restrictions\", \"conceptual\": \"debit card, credit card, card classification, account features\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Debit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Card Logistics\", \"Features And Limits\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_78c7cb79\", \"content\": \"Question: How do the physical and digital versions of my Horizon card differ in terms of functionality and usage?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, our digital card offers a wide range of capabilities, allowing you to execute virtually all card-related transactions within Singapore through various platforms, including Apple Pay, Google Pay, and the FairPrice App, thereby providing a seamless and convenient experience.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_6f303f5f\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I utilize my Horizon card for international transactions, including point-of-sale purchases and ATM withdrawals?\\n\\nAnswer: When conducting overseas transactions, if a merchant requests that you enter a PIN, kindly ask them to process the transaction using a signature or contactless method instead. Should the merchant still require a PIN, you can conveniently set or reset your Horizon card PIN via the Horizon App. For ATM withdrawals, please ensure that you only use ATMs bearing the VISA – Plus Logo and those that support {{faq_6f303f5f_001}}-digit PINs, as our cards are not compatible with {{faq_6f303f5f_002}}-digit PIN ATMs. If you have both a Horizon Link credit card account and a savings account, we advise pairing your card with your savings account. When withdrawing cash from an ATM, select the 'Savings Account' option to ensure that the funds are deducted from your savings account. Note that if you withdraw cash using the credit account option, it will be considered a cash advance and will incur a cash advance fee, effective from {{faq_6f303f5f_003}} Feb {{faq_6f303f5f_004}}, as well as interest charges.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_6dae126c\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the process for updating the personal identification number associated with my Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: To update your Horizon card PIN, follow these straightforward steps: \\n      * Access your Horizon App account\\n      * Navigate to the 'Card Details' section\\n      * Choose the 'Modify PIN' option and create a new {{faq_6dae126c_001}}-digit PIN for enhanced security and convenience\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Return one result for every supplied task_id.\n        - For SUFFICIENT, return only parent IDs from that exact task that are directly relevant. At least one approved ID is required.\n        - For RETRY, return no approved IDs and concise query-refinement feedback. The backend determines terminal UNAVAILABLE status after three failed attempts.\n        - Treat {placeholders} in parent content as valid approved facts.\n        - Never invent a parent ID, fact, or instruction.\n\n        Output JSON only: {\"task_results\": [{\"task_id\": \"...\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\" | \"RETRY\" | \"UNAVAILABLE\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"...\"], \"reason\": \"...\", \"search_feedback\": \"...\"}]}\n        "}
