ut if we need to contact you for clarification, the overall process may take up to five business days.\nUser: How do I open an account, I lost my credit card, and how can I start buying stocks?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Horizon App, MyInfo verification, application submission\", \"policy\": \"Singapore residency, age requirement, document submission\", \"conceptual\": \"Horizon Savings Account, MyInfo service\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Application\", \"Eligibility\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_70aebcd6\", \"content\": \"Question: What information and tools are necessary to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b70c251f\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it possible to open a Horizon Bank account through the Horizon App while I am abroad?\\n\\nAnswer: - At present, Horizon Bank does not permit account applications from outside Singapore. You must be a Singapore resident and submit the request locally.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_586ee40c\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical time required to complete a Horizon Bank application?\\n\\nAnswer: - The submission usually takes only a few minutes.\\n- If further clarification is needed and we must contact you, the process may extend to a maximum of five business days.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Horizon App, card dashboard, freeze card, order replacement\", \"policy\": \"security policy, reporting requirements\", \"conceptual\": \"lost card, credit card logistics\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Card Logistics\", \"Authentication And Security\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_30340b12\", \"content\": \"Question: What measures are being taken by Horizon Bank to mitigate security threats and protect users from fraudulent activities?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we are implementing enhancements to combat fraudulent schemes, particularly those that involve impersonation through PayNow transactions, thereby safeguarding our customers from potential deception.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_74392fe2\", \"content\": \"Question: I've applied for a new Horizon card, but it hasn't arrived yet. What steps can I take to resolve the issue?\\n\\nAnswer: To address the non-receipt of your replacement Horizon card, please get in touch with our dedicated support team through the following channels: \\n    * Utilize the live chat feature or initiate a voice call directly from your Horizon App \\n    * Alternatively, you can reach us by dialing +{{faq_74392fe2_001}} {{faq_74392fe2_002}}-HORIZON\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"securities trading account, setup, fund from Savings, place orders\", \"policy\": \"age requirement, non-US person status, approval process\", \"conceptual\": \"securities trading, stocks, investment\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"Wealth And Insurance\", \"General Inquiries\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_c8d61dc6\", \"content\": \"Question: What investment opportunities are available through Horizon Bank's stock trading services?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_502da680\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the initial steps to begin buying and selling securities with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate trading activities, it is necessary to establish a securities trading account. This can be accomplished by navigating to the Horizon App, selecting the Investments option, and then choosing the Stocks feature. Upon doing so, adhere to the on-screen prompts to finalize the account setup. Please be aware that the approval to open this account is contingent upon an internal evaluation conducted by Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e94ad933\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the eligibility criteria for creating a Stocks account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To be eligible for a Stocks account, you must meet the following conditions: \\n      * You should have an active Savings account with Horizon Bank. If you haven't already, you can easily open one through the Horizon App.\\n      * Your age should be between {{faq_e94ad933_001}} and {{faq_e94ad933_002}} years. Additionally, please be aware that individuals classified as US persons are not eligible to open a Stocks account with Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2fe9ef88\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm experiencing difficulties with the Horizon Bank mobile application. How can I obtain technical assistance?\\n\\nAnswer: To resolve the issue, you can reach out to our dedicated support team through the in-app messaging feature or by dialing +{{faq_2fe9ef88_001}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_002}}-HORIZON (+{{faq_2fe9ef88_003}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_004}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_005}}) for personalized guidance.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Return one result for every supplied task_id.\n        - For SUFFICIENT, return only parent IDs from that exact task that are directly relevant. At least one approved ID is required.\n        - For RETRY, return no approved IDs and concise query-refinement feedback. The backend determines terminal UNAVAILABLE status after three failed attempts.\n        - Treat {placeholders} in parent content as valid approved facts.\n        - Never invent a parent ID, fact, or instruction.\n\n        Output JSON only: {\"task_results\": [{\"task_id\": \"...\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\" | \"RETRY\" | \"UNAVAILABLE\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"...\"], \"reason\": \"...\", \"search_feedback\": \"...\"}]}\n        "}
