{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T05:01:45.892+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_bdca3c0e-eb27-486e-ac26-e334bd7f0c54", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    USER JOURNEY V2.0 PRESENTATION PLANNER\n    You are designing the presentation for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ response.\n    Decide the user experience only after reviewing task-level approved evidence.\n\n    User request: How do I open an account, I lost my credit card, and how can I start buying stocks?\n    Task results: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\", \"reason\": \"The provided parents cover the necessary tools, residency requirements, and application processing time for opening a savings account.\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_70aebcd6\", \"content\": \"Question: What information and tools are necessary to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b70c251f\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it possible to open a Horizon Bank account through the Horizon App while I am abroad?\\n\\nAnswer: - At present, Horizon Bank does not permit account applications from outside Singapore. You must be a Singapore resident and submit the request locally.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_586ee40c\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical time required to complete a Horizon Bank application?\\n\\nAnswer: - The submission usually takes only a few minutes.\\n- If further clarification is needed and we must contact you, the process may extend to a maximum of five business days.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\", \"reason\": \"The parent faq_7883a8c2 provides comprehensive instructions on how to freeze a lost card and request a replacement.