{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T05:01:52.340+00:00", "event": "llm.response", "session_id": "sess_bdca3c0e-eb27-486e-ac26-e334bd7f0c54", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "raw_response": "{\"blocks\":[{\"task_id\":\"task_1\",\"answer\":\"Here’s how to open a Horizon Savings Account:\",\"step_details\":[\"Confirm residency in Singapore – you must be a Singapore citizen, permanent resident, or hold a valid work pass. Applications from abroad are not permitted.\",\"Prepare MyInfo verification – ensure you have a Singapore‑registered mobile phone linked to MyInfo; the app will auto‑populate your details.\",\"Submit application via app – open the Horizon app, complete the form and submit. Submission usually takes a few minutes and may take up to five business days if clarification is needed.\"]},{\"task_id\":\"task_2\",\"answer\":\"If your card is missing, follow these steps:\",\"step_details\":[\"Freeze card in app – sign in to the Horizon app, go to the card overview screen, tap “View & Manage Card” and select “Freeze Card.”\",\"Order replacement card – after freezing, tap “Order Replacement.” The new card will have a different number; remember to update any recurring payments.\"],\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Contact support\",\"message\":\"I need further assistance with my lost card.\"}]},{\"task_id\":\"task_3\",\"answer\":\"To open a Stocks account, you need to meet the following requirements:\",\"list_items\":[\"Have an active Horizon Savings account (open one via the Horizon app if you don’t already have it).\",\"Be between {{faq_e94ad933_001}} and {{faq_e94ad933_002}} years old; US persons are not eligible.\",\"Complete the Stocks account setup in the Horizon app under Investments → Stocks and follow the on‑screen prompts.\",\"The account is subject to internal approval by Horizon Bank before you can trade.\",\"Once approved, fund the Stocks account from your Savings account to start buying shares.\"]}],\"clarification\":\"\"}", "elapsed_ms": 4240.46