{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T05:31:01.562+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_faaadbe1-b0c5-43e4-984d-008824e3874c", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently. A parent is sufficient only if it directly supports that task.\n\n        User Request: How do I open an account, I lost my credit card, and how can I start buying stocks?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nDiscussed opening a Horizon Savings account: requires Singapore residency (citizen, PR, or work pass), MyInfo‑linked mobile, application via Horizon app in Singapore, submission minutes, up to five business days. Card loss: freeze card in app then order replacement; same process for credit and debit cards, choose “Lost card”. Stocks account: need active Savings account, age 18‑74, non‑US persons, set up in app under Investments→Stocks, internal approval, fund from Savings to trade.\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back! Previously I explained the FAQ steps for opening a Horizon Savings account and handling a lost card—let me know if you'd like to continue that or discuss something else.\nUser: How do I open an account, I lost my credit card, and how can I start buying stocks?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Horizon App, application, MyInfo, SingPass, submission\", \"policy\": \"eligibility, Singapore residency, age requirement, processing time\", \"conceptual\": \"Horizon Savings account, MyInfo service, digital onboarding\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Application\", \"Eligibility\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_b70c251f\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it possible to open a Horizon Bank account through the Horizon App while I am abroad?\\n\\nAnswer: - At present, Horizon Bank does not permit account applications from outside Singapore. You must be a Singapore resident and submit the request locally.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_70aebcd6\", \"content\": \"Question: What information and tools are necessary to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_93d37190\", \"content\": \"Question: After opening a savings account, am I eligible to apply for a Horizon credit card?\\n\\nAnswer: - Eligibility criteria:\\n  - You are between {{faq_93d37190_001}} and {{faq_93d37190_002}} years old and earn at least {{faq_93d37190_003}} annually, and you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n  - You are older than {{faq_93d37190_004}} years and earn at least {{faq_93d37190_005}} annually, and you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\nOnly Singapore citizens and permanent residents can hold both a Horizon savings account and a Horizon credit card. To submit an application, go to **More > More for you** within the Horizon App.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_586ee40c\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical time required to complete a Horizon Bank application?\\n\\nAnswer: - The submission usually takes only a few minutes.\\n- If further clarification is needed and we must contact you, the process may extend to a maximum of five business days.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Horizon App, freeze card, order replacement, report lost\", \"policy\": \"security policy, card replacement rules\", \"conceptual\": \"credit card, lost card protocol\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Card Logistics\", \"Authentication And Security\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_74392fe2\", \"content\": \"Question: I've applied for a new Horizon card, but it hasn't arrived yet. What steps can I take to resolve the issue?\\n\\nAnswer: To address the non-receipt of your replacement Horizon card, please get in touch with our dedicated support team through the following channels: \\n    * Utilize the live chat feature or initiate a voice call directly from your Horizon App \\n    * Alternatively, you can reach us by dialing +{{faq_74392fe2_001}} {{faq_74392fe2_002}}-HORIZON\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_83fb94a7\", \"content\": \"Question: If I request a lost‑card replacement for my current Horizon Link credit/debit card, will the existing physical card still accumulate Linkpoints while I wait for the new one?\\n\\nAnswer: - No. After you select the lost‑card replacement option, the original Horizon Link card stops earning Linkpoints. You will only be able to collect points with the replacement NTUC Link credit/debit card once it arrives, or through the FairPrice app by entering the new NTUC Link card details that appear in your Horizon App during the interim.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"Horizon App, Investments, Stocks, fund account, trade\", \"policy\": \"age requirement, non-US person, internal approval\", \"conceptual\": \"securities account, stock trading\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"Wealth And Insurance\", \"General Inquiries\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_e94ad933\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the eligibility criteria for creating a Stocks account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To be eligible for a Stocks account, you must meet the following conditions: \\n      * You should have an active Savings account with Horizon Bank. If you haven't already, you can easily open one through the Horizon App.\\n      * Your age should be between {{faq_e94ad933_001}} and {{faq_e94ad933_002}} years. Additionally, please be aware that individuals classified as US persons are not eligible to open a Stocks account with Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_c8d61dc6\", \"content\": \"Question: What investment opportunities are available through Horizon Bank's stock trading services?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e6babddf\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm unable to locate the investment portfolio feature within the Horizon App. What could be the reason for this?\\n\\nAnswer: To access the investment features on the Horizon App, you must meet specific eligibility criteria. Additionally, ensure you're running the most current version of the Horizon App. If you require assistance, our support team is available through the in-app messaging service or by calling +{{faq_e6babddf_001}} {{faq_e6babddf_002}}-HORIZON (+{{faq_e6babddf_003}} {{faq_e6babddf_004}} {{faq_e6babddf_005}}).\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2fe9ef88\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm experiencing difficulties with the Horizon Bank mobile application. How can I obtain technical assistance?\\n\\nAnswer: To resolve the issue, you can reach out to our dedicated support team through the in-app messaging feature or by dialing +{{faq_2fe9ef88_001}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_002}}-HORIZON (+{{faq_2fe9ef88_003}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_004}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_005}}) for personalized guidance.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Return one result for every supplied task_id.\n        - For SUFFICIENT, return only parent IDs from that exact task that are directly relevant. At least one approved ID is required.\n        - For RETRY, return no approved IDs and concise query-refinement feedback. The backend determines terminal UNAVAILABLE status after three failed attempts.\n        - Treat {placeholders} in parent content as valid approved facts.\n        - Never invent a parent ID, fact, or instruction.\n\n        Output JSON only: {\"task_results\": [{\"task_id\": \"...\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\" | \"RETRY\" | \"UNAVAILABLE\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"...\"], \"reason\": \"...\", \"search_feedback\": \"...\"}]}\n     