{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T05:35:40.076+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_faaadbe1-b0c5-43e4-984d-008824e3874c", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently. A parent is sufficient only if it directly supports that task.\n\n        User Request: How do I open an account, I lost my credit card, and how can I start buying stocks?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: How do I open an account, I lost my credit card, and how can I start buying stocks?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"application process, document submission, account setup\", \"policy\": \"eligibility requirements, age criteria, residency status\", \"conceptual\": \"deposit account, bank account opening\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Application\", \"Eligibility\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_70aebcd6\", \"content\": \"Question: What information and tools are necessary to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_93d37190\", \"content\": \"Question: After opening a savings account, am I eligible to apply for a Horizon credit card?\\n\\nAnswer: - Eligibility criteria:\\n  - You are between {{faq_93d37190_001}} and {{faq_93d37190_002}} years old and earn at least {{faq_93d37190_003}} annually, and you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n  - You are older than {{faq_93d37190_004}} years and earn at least {{faq_93d37190_005}} annually, and you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\nOnly Singapore citizens and permanent residents can hold both a Horizon savings account and a Horizon credit card. To submit an application, go to **More > More for you** within the Horizon App.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b70c251f\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it possible to open a Horizon Bank account through the Horizon App while I am abroad?\\n\\nAnswer: - At present, Horizon Bank does not permit account applications from outside Singapore. You must be a Singapore resident and submit the request locally.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_586ee40c\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical time required to complete a Horizon Bank application?\\n\\nAnswer: - The submission usually takes only a few minutes.\\n- If further clarification is needed and we must contact you, the process may extend to a maximum of five business days.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"report loss, card blocking, replacement request\", \"policy\": \"security protocols, liability rules, card replacement fees\", \"conceptual\": \"lost card, credit card security\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Card Logistics\", \"Authentication And Security\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_bfe32bf8\", \"content\": \"Question: What actions should I take if I suspect fraudulent or suspicious activity on my account?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you believe you have been targeted by fraud, immediately freeze your Horizon card and reach out to us without delay. We also recommend filing a report with local law enforcement. You can lock your card through the Horizon App: from the home screen select \\\"View and Manage card\\\" and then choose \\\"Lock card\\\". For any additional inquiries, contact us via the voice call or live‑chat feature in the Horizon App, or call our hotline at +{{faq_bfe32bf8_001}} {{faq_bfe32bf8_002}}-HORIZON ( +{{faq_bfe32bf8_003}} {{faq_bfe32bf8_004}} {{faq_bfe32bf8_005}} ).\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_759615ac\", \"content\": \"Question: How does a magnetic‑stripe transaction differ from an EMV chip transaction?\\n\\nAnswer: - The magnetic stripe on the back of your Horizon card stores the account data in a static format that can be easily duplicated by fraudsters.\\\\n- In contrast, the EMV chip embedded on the front of the Horizon card houses a micro‑processor that encrypts each transaction, making it virtually impossible to clone.\\\\n- The chip solution meets the Monetary Authority of Singapore’s heightened data‑security standards, providing stronger safeguards against unauthorized use.\\\\n- When a merchant processes a magnetic‑stripe purchase, the card is simply swiped through the reader.\\\\n- For an EMV chip purchase, the card must be inserted into the point‑of‑sale terminal so the chip can authenticate the transaction.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"account setup, trading platform access, order execution\", \"policy\": \"investment eligibility, risk disclosure, trading limits\", \"conceptual\": \"stock market, investment account, brokerage services\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"Wealth And Insurance\", \"General Inquiries\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_c8d61dc6\", \"content\": \"Question: What investment opportunities are available through Horizon Bank's stock trading services?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_3fb1caf7\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it necessary to preload my investment account for automated stock purchases?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, your automated investments are seamlessly facilitated without requiring a separate preload of funds. For each scheduled investment, the necessary amount will be automatically deducted from your Horizon Savings account in Singapore Dollars and converted to US Dollars at the current exchange rate. As a courtesy, you will receive a notification one day prior to the scheduled investment. To avoid any issues, please ensure that your Savings account with Horizon Bank has adequate funds to cover the upcoming investment.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b73dbebe\", \"content\": \"Question: Does Horizon Bank offer personalized investment guidance to its clients?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank maintains a neutral stance and does not extend investment advice to its customers, allowing them to make independent decisions regarding their financial portfolios.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_502da680\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the initial steps to begin buying and selling securities with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate trading activities, it is necessary to establish a securities trading account. This can be accomplished by navigating to the Horizon App, selecting the Investments option, and then choosing the Stocks feature. Upon doing so, adhere to the on-screen prompts to finalize the account setup. Please be aware that the approval to open this account is contingent upon an internal evaluation conducted by Horizon Bank.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Return one result for every supplied task_id.\n        - For SUFFICIENT, return only parent IDs from that exact task that are directly relevant. At least one approved ID is required.\n        - For RETRY, return no approved IDs and concise query-refinement feedback. The backend determines terminal UNAVAILABLE status after three failed attempts.\n        - Treat {placeholders} in parent content as valid approved facts.\n        - Never invent a parent ID, fact, or instruction.\n\n        Output JSON only: {\"task_results\": [{\"task_id\": \"...\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\" | \"RETRY\" | \"UNAVAILABLE\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"...\"], \"reason\": \"...\", \"search_feedback\": \"...\"}]}\n        "}
