{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T05:35:49.200+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_faaadbe1-b0c5-43e4-984d-008824e3874c", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    You are an evidence-groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n\n    User Request: \"How do I open an account, I lost my credit card, and how can I start buying stocks?\"\n    Is Initial Greeting: False\n\n    Selected Approved Knowledge for the Answer:\n    \"[Task task_1 | Opening a Savings Account | Parent faq_70aebcd6]\\nQuestion: What information and tools are necessary to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\n\nAnswer: - A mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto‑populate your application form.\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\\n\\n---\\n\\n[Task task_1 | Opening a Savings Account | Parent faq_b70c251f]\\nQuestion: Is it possible to open a Horizon Bank account through the Horizon App while I am abroad?\n\nAnswer: - At present, Horizon Bank does not permit account applications from outside Singapore. You must be a Singapore resident and submit the request locally.\\n\\n---\\n\\n[Task task_1 | Opening a Savings Account | Parent faq_586ee40c]\\nQuestion: What is the typical time required to complete a Horizon Bank application?\n\nAnswer: - The submission usually takes only a few minutes.\n- If further clarification is needed and we must contact you, the process may extend to a maximum of five business days.\\n\\n---\\n\\n[Task task_2 | Lost or Stolen Card | Parent faq_7883a8c2]\\nQuestion: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\n\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \"View & Manage Card.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \"Freeze Card.\"\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \"View & Manage Card.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \"Freeze Card\" followed by \"Order Replacement.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\n- For additional assistance, select \"Contact Us\" from the app menu.\\n\\n---\\n\\n[Task task_3 | Starting Stock Trading | Parent faq_502da680]\\nQuestion: What are the initial steps to begin buying and selling securities with Horizon Bank?\n\nAnswer: To initiate trading activities, it is necessary to establish a securities trading account. This can be accomplished by navigating to the Horizon App, selecting the Investments option, and then choosing the Stocks feature. Upon doing so, adhere to the on-screen prompts to finalize the account setup. Please be aware that the approval to open this account is contingent upon an internal evaluation conducted by Horizon Bank.\\n\\n---\\n\\n[Task task_3 | Starting Stock Trading | Parent faq_c8d61dc6]\\nQuestion: What investment opportunities are available through Horizon Bank's stock trading services?\n\nAnswer: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\"\n\n    Unapproved Retrieved Knowledge Permitted Only for Terminal Retrieval Clarification:\n    \"\"\n\n    Intent-clarification and greeting sources:\n    \"{\"intent_tasks\": [], \"greeting_memory\": \"Latest Session Memory:\\nNone\\n\\nUser Baseline Memory:\\nNone\"}\"\n\n    Customer-Facing Answer:\n 