eplacement request\", \"policy\": \"card replacement eligibility, security protocol, card type restrictions\", \"conceptual\": \"credit card, debit card, card logistics\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Card Logistics\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_98eb6af4\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm currently using my Horizon Link Credit/Debit Card, but my Horizon App displays the NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card. How can I obtain a physical version of the NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card?\\n\\nAnswer: To receive a physical NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card, you'll need to initiate a lost card replacement process through the Horizon App. It's essential to choose the correct replacement option, as selecting 'damaged card' will not yield the desired outcome. Please be aware that replacing your card will result in changes to your card details, including the card number, CVV, and expiry date. Consequently, you will need to update your card information for any existing online credit card arrangements, such as card-on-file and recurring payments, to ensure uninterrupted service.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_adff3913\", \"content\": \"Question: After I complete my credit card application through a partner or affiliate platform, what steps follow?\\n\\nAnswer: - You will receive an immediate notification of the decision via email or SMS.\\n- If the application is approved, the message will contain instructions for logging into the Horizon App and activating your new Horizon card.\\n- If the application is declined, you will be informed of the outcome through an email or text.\\n- When a decision cannot be made instantly or additional documentation is required, we will email you with directions to access the Horizon App, review your pending status, and upload the needed documents.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Return one result for every supplied task_id.\n        - For SUFFICIENT, return only parent IDs from that exact task that are directly relevant. At least one approved ID is required.\n        - For RETRY, return no approved IDs and concise query-refinement feedback. The backend determines terminal UNAVAILABLE status after three failed attempts.\n        - Treat {placeholders} in parent content as valid approved facts.\n        - Never invent a parent ID, fact, or instruction.\n\n        Output JSON only: {\"task_results\": [{\"task_id\": \"...\", \"status\":