{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T05:47:48.529+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_faaadbe1-b0c5-43e4-984d-008824e3874c", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently. A parent is sufficient only if it directly supports that task.\n\n        User Request: does the replace card procedure applies to both credit card and debit card?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: does the replace card procedure applies to both credit card and debit card?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"compare, replacement, procedure, card logistics\", \"policy\": \"standardization, consistency, cross-product rules\", \"conceptual\": \"card replacement, credit card, debit card, Horizon Bank\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Card Logistics\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_98eb6af4\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm currently using my Horizon Link Credit/Debit Card, but my Horizon App displays the NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card. How can I obtain a physical version of the NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card?\\n\\nAnswer: To receive a physical NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card, you'll need to initiate a lost card replacement process through the Horizon App. It's essential to choose the correct replacement option, as selecting 'damaged card' will not yield the desired outcome. Please be aware that replacing your card will result in changes to your card details, including the card number, CVV, and expiry date. Consequently, you will need to update your card information for any existing online credit card arrangements, such as card-on-file and recurring payments, to ensure uninterrupted service.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_83fb94a7\", \"content\": \"Question: If I request a lost‑card replacement for my current Horizon Link credit/debit card, will the existing physical card still accumulate Linkpoints while I wait for the new one?\\n\\nAnswer: - No. After you select the lost‑card replacement option, the original Horizon Link card stops earning Linkpoints. You will only be able to collect points with the replacement NTUC Link credit/debit card once it arrives, or through the FairPrice app by entering the new NTUC Link card details that appear in your Horizon App during the interim.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"compare, replacement, procedure, card logistics\", \"policy\": \"standardization, consistency, cross-product rules\", \"conceptual\": \"card replacement, credit card, debit card, Horizon Bank\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Debit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Card Logistics\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_5ad80c63\", \"content\": \"Question: When can I expect my physical Horizon card to be delivered?\\n\\nAnswer: - The Horizon physical card will be mailed to you and should arrive within {{faq_5ad80c63_001}}‑{{faq_5ad80c63_002}} business days from the date you applied.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_74392fe2\", \"content\": \"Question: I've applied for a new Horizon card, but it hasn't arrived yet. What steps can I take to resolve the issue?\\n\\nAnswer: To address the non-receipt of your replacement Horizon card, please get in touch with our dedicated support team through the following channels: \\n    * Utilize the live chat feature or initiate a voice call directly from your Horizon App \\n    * Alternatively, you can reach us by dialing +{{faq_74392fe2_001}} {{faq_74392fe2_002}}-HORIZON\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Return one result for every supplied task_id.\n        - For SUFFICIENT, return only parent IDs from that exact task that are directly relevant. At least one approved ID is required.\n        - For RETRY, return no approved IDs and concise query-refinement feedback. The backend determines terminal UNAVAILABLE status after three failed attempts.\n        - Treat {placeholders} in parent content as valid approved facts.\n        - Never invent a parent ID, fact, or instruction.\n\n        Output JSON only: {\"task_results\": [{\"task_id\": \"...\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\" | \"RETRY\" | \"UNAVAILABLE\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"...\"], \"reason\": \"...\", \"search_feedback\": \"...\"}]}\n        "}
