{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T05:48:13.968+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_faaadbe1-b0c5-43e4-984d-008824e3874c", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    You are an independent Compliance Auditor for a Singaporean Bank.\n\n    Regulatory Context:\n    \n1. Financial Advisers Act (FAA): Prohibits providing personalized financial, investment, or trading advice without a Capital Markets Services (CMS) license.\n2. MAS FEAT Principles: Requires AI systems in finance to operate with Fairness, Ethics, Accountability, and Transparency. Forbids biased, unethical, or deceptive behavior.\n3. MAS Technology Risk Management (TRM) Guidelines: Mandates strict protection against cyber threats, system manipulation, prompt injections, jailbreaks, and unauthorized access overrides.\n4. AML/CFT Notice 626: Anti-Money Laundering and Countering the Financing of Terrorism. Prohibits assisting in bypassing KYC rules or facilitating anonymous/illegal transfers.\n\n\n    Customer-Facing Answer:\n    \"Yes, the card replacement procedure applies to both Horizon credit and debit cards. Whether you are using a Horizon Link credit or debit card, you can initiate a replacement through the Horizon App.\n\nPlease note that replacing your card will result in changes to your card details, including the card number, CVV, and expiry date. You will need to update your card information for any existing online arrangements, such as card-on-file and recurring payments, to ensure your service remains uninterrupted.\n\nAccess your Horizon App account.\n\nNavigate to the 'Card Management' section.\n\nOpen the card dashboard and choose 'View & Manage Card'.\n\nTap 'Freeze Card' followed by 'Order Replacement'.\n\n\"\n\n    Customer-Facing Clarification:\n    \"\"\n\n    Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n    \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Yes, the card replacement procedure applies to both Horizon credit and debit cards. Whether you are using a Horizon Link credit or debit card, you can initiate a replacement through the Horizon App.\\n\\nPlease note that replacing your card will result in changes to your card details, including the card number, CVV, and expiry date. You will need to update your card information for any existing online arrangements, such as card-on-file and recurring payments, to ensure your service remains uninterrupted.\", \"items\": [], \"options\": [{\"label\": \"How to replace card\", \"message\": \"How do I request a replacement for my Horizon card?\"}], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSteps\": null, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}, {\"type\": \"stepper\", \"text\": \"\", \"items\": [{\"number\": 1, \"label\": \"Access Horizon App account\", \"status\": \"current\"}, {\"number\": 2, \"label\": \"Navigate to Card Management\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}, {\"number\": 3, \"label\": \"Select your physical card\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}, {\"number\": 4, \"label\": \"Choose Replace Current Card\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"Steps to Replace Your Card\", \"stepDetails\": [\"Access your Horizon App account.\", \"Navigate to the 'Card Management' section.\", \"Open the card dashboard and choose 'View & Manage Card'.\", \"Tap 'Freeze Card' followed by 'Order Replacement'.\"], \"currentStep\": 1, \"totalSteps\": 4, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}]}\"\n\n    TASK: Assess COMPLIANCE ONLY. Do not assess whether facts are supported by\n    evidence; a separate auditor handles groundedness. Determine whether any\n    customer-facing text, UI item, option, step, list entry, or extended text\n    provides unauthorized personalized financial advice, subjective product\n    recommendation, return forecast, transaction execution, deceptive claim,\n    or assistance to bypass security, KYC, AML/CFT, or other controls.\n    Neutral factual information, safe apologies, and neutral clarification\n    requests are compliant. Every visible field in the payload is in scope.\n\n    Output JSON only:\n    {\"passed\": true/false, \"reason\": \"...\", \"rewrite_instruction\": \"...\"}\n    "}
{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T05:48:13.969+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_faaadbe1-b0c5-43e4-984d-008824e3874c", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    You are an evidence-groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n\n    User Request: \"does the replace card procedure applies to both credit card and debit card?\"\n    Is Initial Greeting: False\n\n    Selected Approved Knowledge for the Answer:\n    \"[Task task_1 | Card Replacement Applicability | Parent faq_98eb6af4]\\nQuestion: I'm currently using my Horizon Link Credit/Debit Card, but my Horizon App displays the NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card. How can I obtain a physical version of the NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card?\n\nAnswer: To receive a physical NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card, you'll need to initiate a lost card replacement process through the Horizon App. It's essential to choose the correct replacement option, as selecting 'damaged card' will not yield the desired outcome. Please be aware that replacing your card will result in changes to your card details, including the card number, CVV, and expiry date. Consequently, you will need to update your card information for any existing online credit card arrangements, such as card-on-file and recurring payments, to ensure uninterrupted service.\\n\\n---\\n\\n[Task task_1 | Card Replacement Applicability | Parent faq_83fb94a7]\\nQuestion: If I request a lost‑card replacement for my current Horizon Link credit/debit card, will the existing physical card still accumulate Linkpoints while I wait for the new one?\n\nAnswer: - No. After you select the lost‑card replacement option, the original Horizon Link card stops earning Linkpoints. You will only be able to collect points with the replacement NTUC Link credit/debit card once it arrives, or through the FairPrice app by entering the new NTUC Link card details that appear in your Horizon App during the interim.\\n\\n---\\n\\n[Task task_2 | Steps to Replace Your Card | Parent faq_33f045af]\\nQuestion: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\n\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \n    * Access your Horizon App account \n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\\n\\n---\\n\\n[Task task_2 | Steps to Replace Your Card | Parent faq_7883a8c2]\\nQuestion: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\n\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \"View & Manage Card.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \"Freeze Card.\"\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \"View & Manage Card.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \"Freeze Card\" followed by \"Order Replacement.\"\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\n- For additional assistance, select \"Contact Us\" from the app menu.\"\n\n    Unapproved Retrieved Knowledge Permitted Only for Terminal Retrieval Clarification:\n    \"\"\n\n    Intent-clarification and greeting sources:\n    \"{\"intent_tasks\": [], \"greeting_memory\": \"Latest Session Memory:\\nNone\\n\\nUser Baseline Memory:\\nNone\"}\"\n\n    Customer-Facing Answer:\n    \"Yes, the card replacement procedure applies to both Horizon credit and debit cards. Whether you are using a Horizon Link credit o