{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T06:56:41.713+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_75e59aaf-3d9a-41e5-8def-675d2b1087c1", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently. A parent is sufficient only if it directly supports that task.\n\n        User Request: How do I open an account, I lost my credit card, and how can I start buying stocks?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: How do I open an account, I lost my credit card, and how can I start buying stocks?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"report loss, request replacement, block card\", \"policy\": \"security protocols, card replacement policy\", \"conceptual\": \"lost card, credit card security\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Card Logistics\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_83fb94a7\", \"content\": \"Question: If I request a lost‑card replacement for my current Horizon Link credit/debit card, will the existing physical card still accumulate Linkpoints while I wait for the new one?\\n\\nAnswer: - No. After you select the lost‑card replacement option, the original Horizon Link card stops earning Linkpoints. You will only be able to collect points with the replacement NTUC Link credit/debit card once it arrives, or through the FairPrice app by entering the new NTUC Link card details that appear in your Horizon App during the interim.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_98eb6af4\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm currently using my Horizon Link Credit/Debit Card, but my Horizon App displays the NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card. How can I obtain a physical version of the NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card?\\n\\nAnswer: To receive a physical NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card, you'll need to initiate a lost card replacement process through the Horizon App. It's essential to choose the correct replacement option, as selecting 'damaged card' will not yield the desired outcome. Please be aware that replacing your card will result in changes to your card details, including the card number, CVV, and expiry date. Consequently, you will need to update your card information for any existing online credit card arrangements, such as card-on-file and recurring payments, to ensure uninterrupted service.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"open investment account, trade stocks, execute orders\", \"policy\": \"trading requirements, investment eligibility\", \"conceptual\": \"stock market, equity trading\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"General Inquiries\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_41bb5359\", \"content\": \"Question: How do investment accounts at Horizon Bank differ from traditional savings accounts in terms of their usage and benefits?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, our investment accounts are specifically designed for trading stocks and ETFs, and they do not offer the same flexibility as our savings accounts for everyday banking needs. Notably, these investment accounts do not accrue interest and are not protected under the Deposit Insurance Scheme, which is managed by the Singapore Deposit Insurance Corporation (SDIC), unlike our savings accounts.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ded247c0\", \"content\": \"Question: What sets Horizon Bank apart from traditional banking institutions?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we've revolutionized the banking experience by leveraging cutting-edge technology to create a seamless, mobile-first platform. By streamlining processes and eliminating the need for physical branches, we're able to provide our customers with a {{faq_ded247c0_001}}/{{faq_ded247c0_002}} banking service that's both convenient and efficient. A prime illustration of this is our expedited sign-up process, which can be completed in mere minutes for Singapore residents utilizing Singpass, highlighting our commitment to simplicity and speed.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7fc44444\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank collaborate with regulatory bodies to combat cyber threats and protect customers from fraudulent activities?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we are committed to safeguarding our customers' interests through a collaborative approach with the Monetary Authority of Singapore and other relevant authorities. The Shared Responsibility Framework is a pivotal initiative that underscores the importance of joint efforts between banks, regulatory bodies, and customers in preventing and mitigating the impact of scams. This framework specifically addresses vulnerabilities that scammers may exploit, including impersonation of legitimate entities, such as government agencies or financial institutions like Horizon Bank, where fraudsters deceive customers into divulging sensitive information. Additionally, it tackles the risks associated with malicious links sent via digital platforms, which can lead to the compromise of account credentials. By promoting a culture of shared responsibility, we aim to empower our customers with the knowledge and best practices necessary to secure their financial information and transactions, thereby fostering a safer digital banking environment for all.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2fe9ef88\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm experiencing difficulties with the Horizon Bank mobile application. How can I obtain technical assistance?\\n\\nAnswer: To resolve the issue, you can reach out to our dedicated support team through the in-app messaging feature or by dialing +{{faq_2fe9ef88_001}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_002}}-HORIZON (+{{faq_2fe9ef88_003}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_004}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_005}}) for personalized guidance.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Return one result for every supplied task_id.\n        - For SUFFICIENT, return only parent IDs from that exact task that are directly relevant. At least one approved ID is required.\n        - For RETRY, return no approved IDs and concise query-refinement feedback. The backend determines terminal UNAVAILABLE status after three fail