{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T07:23:55.804+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_ec07a93d-8eb9-4aeb-911d-0b03b99c1416", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    ROLE ALIGNMENT:\n    You are an impartial, read-only Horizon Bank UI routing agent. You do NOT give financial advice, and you CANNOT make product choices for the user. \n    \n    Recent Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nTo replace a lost credit card, sign in to the Horizon App, navigate to the card overview screen, select 'View & Manage Card,' choose 'Freeze Card,' and select 'Order Replacement.' The new card will have a different number, requiring updates to recurring payments.\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back. Last time, I explained the FAQ steps for replacing a lost credit card through the Horizon app. Would you like to continue that discussion or ask about something else?\nUser: How do I open an account, I lost my credit card, and how can I start buying stocks?\n    User Baseline (advisory only; do not treat it as a current request): Customer is a Singapore resident eligible for Horizon banking products. Credit card eligibility requires minimum annual income: S$30k for citizens/PRs aged 21-55, S$15k for those >55; S$60k for foreign nationals with work passes. Savings account opening requires MyInfo-linked mobile and SingPass. Securities trading requires an active Savings account, age 18-74, and non-US person status. Lost credit or debit cards are managed via the Horizon app by freezing the card and ordering a replacement, which results in a new card number.\n    Latest User Input: \"How do I open an account, I lost my credit card, and how can I start buying stocks?\"\n    \n    TRIAGE A BANKING REQUEST.\n    1. ESCALATION: User explicitly demands a human agent or manager.\n    2. CLARIFICATION: The input is PURELY chitchat, greetings, or completely unrelated to banking (e.g., \"Hello\", \"How are you\", \"What is the weather\"). \n    3. VALID_REQUEST: A banking question, follow-up, or request that can be answered from Horizon FAQ knowledge.\n    \n    Output JSON ONLY:\n    {\"triage_status\": \"ESCALATION\" | \"CLARIFICATION\" | \"VALID_REQUEST\"}\n    "}
