{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T07:24:03.025+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_ec07a93d-8eb9-4aeb-911d-0b03b99c1416", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently. A parent is sufficient only if it directly supports that task.\n\n        User Request: How do I open an account, I lost my credit card, and how can I start buying stocks?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nTo replace a lost credit card, sign in to the Horizon App, navigate to the card overview screen, select 'View & Manage Card,' choose 'Freeze Card,' and select 'Order Replacement.' The new card will have a different number, requiring updates to recurring payments.\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back. Last time, I explained the FAQ steps for replacing a lost credit card through the Horizon app. Would you like to continue that discussion or ask about something else?\nUser: How do I open an account, I lost my credit card, and how can I start buying stocks?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Horizon App, MyInfo, SingPass, account setup\", \"policy\": \"eligibility, age requirements, residency status\", \"conceptual\": \"Deposit Account, banking services\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Application\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_70aebcd6\", \"content\": \"Question: What information and tools are necessary to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_586ee40c\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical time required to complete a Horizon Bank application?\\n\\nAnswer: - The submission usually takes only a few minutes.\\n- If further clarification is needed and we must contact you, the process may extend to a maximum of five business days.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_357dd970\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical duration for completing a Horizon Bank application?\\n\\nAnswer: - The submission is usually processed within a few minutes.\\n- Should we need to reach out for further clarification, the review period can extend to as long as five business days.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Horizon App, freeze card, order replacement\", \"policy\": \"security, card replacement, reporting lost card\", \"conceptual\": \"Credit Card, card logistics\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Card Logistics\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_74392fe2\", \"content\": \"Question: I've applied for a new Horizon card, but it hasn't arrived yet. What steps can I take to resolve the issue?\\n\\nAnswer: To address the non-receipt of your replacement Horizon card, please get in touch with our dedicated support team through the following channels: \\n    * Utilize the live chat feature or initiate a voice call directly from your Horizon App \\n    * Alternatively, you can reach us by dialing +{{faq_74392fe2_001}} {{faq_74392fe2_002}}-HORIZON\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_adff3913\", \"content\": \"Question: After I complete my credit card application through a partner or affiliate platform, what steps follow?\\n\\nAnswer: - You will receive an immediate notification of the decision via email or SMS.\\n- If the application is approved, the message will contain instructions for logging into the Horizon App and activating your new Horizon card.\\n- If the application is declined, you will be informed of the outcome through an email or text.\\n- When a decision cannot be made instantly or additional documentation is required, we will email you with directions to access the Horizon App, review your pending status, and upload the needed documents.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"Horizon App, account linking, trading setup\", \"policy\": \"eligibility, age requirements, non-US person status\", \"conceptual\": \"Stocks, wealth management, investment\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"Wealth And Insurance\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_502da680\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the initial steps to begin buying and selling securities with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate trading activities, it is necessary to establish a securities trading account. This can be accomplished by navigating to the Horizon App, selecting the Investments option, and then choosing the Stocks feature. Upon doing so, adhere to the on-screen prompts to finalize the account setup. Please be aware that the approval to open this account is contingent upon an internal evaluation conducted by Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_c8d61dc6\", \"content\": \"Question: What investment opportunities are available through Horizon Bank's stock trading services?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e94ad933\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the eligibility criteria for creating a Stocks account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To be eligible for a Stocks account, you must meet the following conditions: \\n      * You should have an active Savings account with Horizon Bank. If you haven't already, you can easily open one through the Horizon App.\\n      * Your age should be between {{faq_e94ad933_001}} and {{faq_e94ad933_002}} years. Additionally, please be aware that individuals classified as US persons are not eligible to open a Stocks account with Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e6babddf\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm unable to locate the investment portfolio feature within the Horizon App. What could be the reason for this?\\n\\nAnswer: To access the investment features on the Horizon App, you must meet specific eligibility criteria. Additionally, ensure you're running the most current version of the Horizon App. If you require assistance, our support team is available through the in-app messaging service or by calling +{{faq_e6babddf_001}} {{faq_e6babddf_002}}-HORIZON (+{{faq_e6babddf_003}} {{faq_e6babddf_004}} {{faq_e6babddf_005}}).\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Return one result for every supplied task_id.\n        - For SUFFICIENT, return only parent IDs from that exact task that are directly relevant. At least one approved ID is required.\n        - For RETRY, return no approved IDs and concise query-refinement feedback. The backend determines terminal UNAVAILABLE status after four failed attempts.\n        - Treat {placeholders} in parent content as valid approved facts.\n        - Never invent a parent ID, fact, or instruction.\n\n        Output JSON only: {\"task_results\": [{\"task_id\": \"...\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\" | \"RETRY\" | \"UNAVAILABLE\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"...\"], \"reason\": \"...\", \"search_feedback\": \"...\"}]}\n        "}
