{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T07:24:11.830+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_ec07a93d-8eb9-4aeb-911d-0b03b99c1416", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    You are an independent Compliance Auditor for a Singaporean Bank.\n\n    Regulatory Context:\n    \n1. Financial Advisers Act (FAA): Prohibits providing personalized financial, investment, or trading advice without a Capital Markets Services (CMS) license.\n2. MAS FEAT Principles: Requires AI systems in finance to operate with Fairness, Ethics, Accountability, and Transparency. Forbids biased, unethical, or deceptive behavior.\n3. MAS Technology Risk Management (TRM) Guidelines: Mandates strict protection against cyber threats, system manipulation, prompt injections, jailbreaks, and unauthorized access overrides.\n4. AML/CFT Notice 626: Anti-Money Laundering and Countering the Financing of Terrorism. Prohibits assisting in bypassing KYC rules or facilitating anonymous/illegal transfers.\n\n\n    Customer-Facing Answer:\n    \"To open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank, you will need your mobile phone and MyInfo verification to auto-populate your application form. Please note that if you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after registering, you will need to authenticate via SingPass when logging in again.\n\nSign in to the Horizon App.\n\nOn the card overview screen, tap \"View & Manage Card.\"\n\nSelect \"Freeze Card.\"\n\nChoose \"Order Replacement\" to have a new card issued and the old one permanently deactivated.\n\nOnce you have frozen your card, you can request a replacement through the card dashboard. Please be aware that your new card will arrive with a different card number, so you will need to update any recurring payments or subscriptions. You may also wish to file a police report for a lost or stolen card.\n\nTo begin buying and selling stocks, you must first establish a securities trading account through the Horizon App by selecting 'Investments' and then 'Stocks'.\nYou must have an active Savings account with Horizon Bank.\nYou must be between 18 and 74 years of age.\nYou must not be classified as a US person.\nAccount approval is subject to an internal evaluation by Horizon Bank.\nFollow the on-screen prompts in the Stocks feature to finalize your setup.\"\n\n    Customer-Facing Clarification:\n    \"\"\n\n    Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n    \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"To open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank, you will need your mobile phone and MyInfo verification to auto-populate your application form. Please note that if you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after registering, you will need to authenticate via SingPass when logging in again.\", \"items\": [], \"options\": [{\"label\": \"Start opening account\", \"message\": \"I would like to start opening a Savings account.\"}], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSteps\": null, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}, {\"type\": \"stepper\", \"text\": \"\", \"items\": [{\"number\": 1, \"label\": \"Sign in to Horizon App\", \"status\": \"current\"}, {\"number\": 2, \"label\": \"Access card overview\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}, {\"number\": 3, \"label\": \"Freeze your card\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}, {\"number\": 4, \"label\": \"Order a replacement\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}], \"options\": [{\"label\": \"Contact support\", \"message\": \"I need further assistance with my lost card.\"}], \"progressTitle\": \"Lost Credit Card Procedure\", \"stepDetails\": [\"Sign in to the Horizon App.\", \"On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\", \"Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\", \"Choose \\\"Order Replacement\\\" to have a new card issued and the old one permane