{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T09:28:29.233+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_efb0fbc6-2b75-42dc-af67-5e0442ac995f", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently. A parent is sufficient only if it directly supports that task.\n\n        User Request: How do I set up recurring automatic investments in individual stocks, what are the eligibility requirements, and how will the purchases be funded?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nHorizon Bank securities trading requires an active Savings account, age 18-74, and non-US person status. Users must open a Stocks account via the Investments section in the Horizon App, subject to internal approval. Automated recurring investments are funded by deducting SGD from the Savings account, converted to USD at current rates. Sufficient funds must be available in the Savings account prior to the scheduled transaction date.\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back. Last time, I provided the FAQ details regarding the eligibility requirements and funding process for securities trading. Would you like to continue that discussion or ask about something else?\nUser: How do I set up recurring automatic investments in individual stocks, what are the eligibility requirements, and how will the purchases be funded?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Horizon App, navigation, setup, recurring investment, stocks\", \"policy\": \"eligibility requirements, age 18-74, non-US person status, internal approval\", \"conceptual\": \"recurring investment, individual stocks, funding process, SGD to USD conversion\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"Wealth And Insurance\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_c8d61dc6\", \"content\": \"Question: What investment opportunities are available through Horizon Bank's stock trading services?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_4bd34aa4\", \"content\": \"Question: At Horizon Bank, what is the lowest investment threshold for purchasing securities?\\n\\nAnswer: With Horizon Bank, you have the flexibility to initiate your investment portfolio by buying stocks and ETFs with a minimum investment of just USD {{faq_4bd34aa4_001}}.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b73dbebe\", \"content\": \"Question: Does Horizon Bank offer personalized investment guidance to its clients?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank maintains a neutral stance and does not extend investment advice to its customers, allowing them to make independent decisions regarding their financial portfolios.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e6babddf\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm unable to locate the investment portfolio feature within the Horizon App. What could be the reason for this?\\n\\nAnswer: To access the investment features on the Horizon App, you must meet specific eligibility criteria. Additionally, ensure you're running the most current version of the Horizon App. If you require assistance, our support team is available through the in-app messaging service or by calling +{{faq_e6babddf_001}} {{faq_e6babddf_002}}-HORIZON (+{{faq_e6babddf_003}} {{faq_e6babddf_004}} {{faq_e6babddf_005}}).\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"check, eligibility, requirements\", \"policy\": \"age 18-74, non-US person status, internal approval\", \"conceptual\": \"securities trading, eligibility criteria\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"General Inquiries\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_2fe9ef88\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm experiencing difficulties with the Horizon Bank mobile application. How can I obtain technical assistance?\\n\\nAnswer: To resolve the issue, you can reach out to our dedicated support team through the in-app messaging feature or by dialing +{{faq_2fe9ef88_001}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_002}}-HORIZON (+{{faq_2fe9ef88_003}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_004}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_005}}) for personalized guidance.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ded247c0\", \"content\": \"Question: What sets Horizon Bank apart from traditional banking institutions?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we've revolutionized the banking experience by leveraging cutting-edge technology to create a seamless, mobile-first platform. By streamlining processes and eliminating the need for physical branches, we're able to provide our customers with a {{faq_ded247c0_001}}/{{faq_ded247c0_002}} banking service that's both convenient and efficient. A prime illustration of this is our expedited sign-up process, which can be completed in mere minutes for Singapore residents utilizing Singpass, highlighting our commitment to simplicity and speed.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"deduct, SGD, Savings account, convert, USD\", \"policy\": \"sufficient funds, scheduled transaction date\", \"conceptual\": \"funding process, currency conversion, recurring investment\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"Wealth And Insurance\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_3fb1caf7\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it necessary to preload my investment account for automated stock purchases?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, your automated investments are seamlessly facilitated without requiring a separate preload of funds. For each scheduled investment, the necessary amount will be automatically deducted from your Horizon Savings account in Singapore Dollars and converted to US Dollars at the current exchange rate. As a courtesy, you will receive a notification one day prior to the scheduled investment. To avoid any issues, please ensure that your Savings account with Horizon Bank has adequate funds to cover the upcoming investment.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_41bb5359\", \"content\": \"Question: How do investment accounts at Horizon Bank differ from traditional savings accounts in terms of their usage and benefits?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, our investment accounts are specifically designed for trading stocks and ETFs, and they do not offer the same flexibility as our savings accounts for everyday banking needs. Notably, these investment accounts do not accrue interest and are not protected under the Deposit Insurance Scheme, which is managed by the Singapore Deposit Insurance Corporation (SDIC), unlike our savings accounts.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_d22a7a8c\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank handle AutoInvest transactions when my Savings account balance is low?\\n\\nAnswer: In the event that your Savings account lacks sufficient funds to cover an AutoInvest transaction, the scheduled investment will be skipped, and you will receive a notification from Horizon Bank. Although the transaction will not be retried on that specific date, you have the option to manually invest by replenishing your account and placing an order through the Horizon App. Provided your AutoInvest configuration remains active, the system will automatically attempt to execute the investment again on the next scheduled date.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b8e22edc\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank's fee structure work for investment transactions?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we provide a competitive fee environment for our investors. Until December {{faq_b8e22edc_001}}, {{faq_b8e22edc_002}}, trading US stocks and ETFs is commission-free. After this period, a commission of {{faq_b8e22edc_003}} applies, with a minimum charge of USD {{faq_b8e22edc_004}} per trade. For UK UCITS ETFs, a commission rate of {{faq_b8e22edc_005}} is applicable, with a minimum fee of USD {{faq_b8e22edc_006}} per trade. Additionally, a {{faq_b8e22edc_007}} GST is levied on commissions, and your Trade Confirmation will also serve as your Tax Invoice. Notably, Horizon Bank does not impose platform, custody, settlement, or corporate action handling fees. For a detailed breakdown, please navigate to the Horizon App, select your Profile, and then access the Legal section to view the Stocks Fee Schedule.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Return one result for every supplied task_id.\n        - For SUFFICIENT, return only parent IDs from that exact task that are directly relevant. At least one approved ID is required.\n        - For RETRY, return no approved IDs and concise query-refinement feedback. The backend determines terminal UNAVAILABLE status after four failed attempts.\n        - Treat {placeholders} in parent content as valid approved facts.\n        - Never invent a parent ID, fact, or instruction.\n\n        Output JSON only: {\"task_results\": [{\"task_id\": \"...\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\" | \"RETRY\" | \"UNAVAILABLE\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"...\"], \"reason\": \"...\", \"search_feedback\": \"...\"}]}\n        "}
