ocess, SGD to USD conversion, funding source\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"Wealth And Insurance\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_2f201863\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps are required to activate the automatic investment feature for equities at Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate automatic investments in stocks with Horizon Bank, ensure you have an active stocks account. Follow these steps: \\n   * Access the Horizon App and navigate to the Investments section\\n   * Select the Stocks option\\n   * Proceed to the setup for automatic investments\\n   * Identify the specific stock or exchange-traded fund you wish to invest in automatically\\n   * Determine your preferred investment schedule and commencement date; if not specified, the next working day will be applied by default\\n   * Specify the amount and currency for regular investments\\n   * Review the details and confirm the setup to complete the process\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_c8d61dc6\", \"content\": \"Question: What investment opportunities are available through Horizon Bank's stock trading services?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e6babddf\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm unable to locate the investment portfolio feature within the Horizon App. What could be the reason for this?\\n\\nAnswer: To access the investment features on the Horizon App, you must meet specific eligibility criteria. Additionally, ensure you're running the most current version of the Horizon App. If you require assistance, our support team is available through the in-app messaging service or by calling +{{faq_e6babddf_001}} {{faq_e6babddf_002}}-HORIZON (+{{faq_e6babddf_003}} {{faq_e6babddf_004}} {{faq_e6babddf_005}}).\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e94ad933\", \"content\"