ufficient. You will receive a notification one day prior to the scheduled investment, and if a transaction is skipped, you may manually place an order through the Horizon App once you have replenished your account.\"\n\n    Customer-Facing Clarification:\n    \"Could you clarify what information you are looking for?\"\n\n    Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n    \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"To set up recurring automatic investments in individual stocks, you must first ensure you have an active Stocks account. You can initiate this by navigating to the Investments section in the Horizon App, selecting the Stocks option, and following the prompts to configure your automatic investment schedule, including the specific stock, investment amount, and frequency. Regarding eligibility, please note that securities trading is available to customers aged 18-74 who are non-US persons, subject to internal approval.\\n\\nYour automated investments are seamlessly facilitated without requiring a separate preload of funds. For each scheduled investment, the necessary amount is automatically deducted from your Horizon Savings account in Singapore Dollars and converted to US Dollars at the current exchange rate. Please ensure your Savings account has adequate funds to cover the investment, as the transaction will be skipped if the balance is insufficient. You will receive a notification one day prior to the scheduled investment, and if a transaction is skipped, you may manually place an order through the Horizon App once you have replenished your account.\", \"items\": [], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSteps\": null, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}, {\"type\": \"clarification\", \"text