 investment guidance to its clients?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank maintains a neutral stance and does not extend investment advice to its customers, allowing them to make independent decisions regarding their financial portfolios.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2f201863\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps are required to activate the automatic investment feature for equities at Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate automatic investments in stocks with Horizon Bank, ensure you have an active stocks account. Follow these steps: \\n   * Access the Horizon App and navigate to the Investments section\\n   * Select the Stocks option\\n   * Proceed to the setup for automatic investments\\n   * Identify the specific stock or exchange-traded fund you wish to invest in automatically\\n   * Determine your preferred investment schedule and commencement date; if not specified, the next working day will be applied by default\\n   * Specify the amount and currency for regular investments\\n   * Review the details and confirm the setup to complete the process\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"verification, qualification check\", \"policy\": \"age requirements, residency status, account ownership, eligibility criteria\", \"conceptual\": \"eligibility, investment services\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"General Inquiries\"], \"customer_component\": \"what are the eligibility requirements\"}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_2fe9ef88\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm experiencing difficulties with the Horizon Bank mobile application. How can I obtain technical assistance?\\n\\nAnswer: To resolve the issue, you can reach out to our dedicated support team through the in-app messaging feature or by dialing +{{faq_2fe9ef88_001}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_002}}-HORIZON (+{{faq_2fe9ef88_003}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_004}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_005}}) for personalized guidance.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ded247c0\", \"content\": \"Question: What sets Horizon Bank apart from traditional banking institutions?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we've revolutionized the banking experience by leveraging cutting-edge technology to create a seamless, mobile-first platform. By streamlining processes and eliminating the need for physical branches, we're able to provide our customers with a {{faq_ded247c0_001}}/{{faq_ded247c0_002}} banking service that's both convenient and efficient. A prime illustration of this is our expedited sign-up process, which can be completed in mere minutes for Singapore residents utilizing Singpass, highlighting our commitment to simplicity and speed.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_41bb5359\", \"content\": \"Question: How do investment accounts at Horizon Bank differ from traditional savings accounts in terms of their usage and benefits?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, our investment accounts are specifically designed for trading stocks and ETFs, and they do not offer the same flexibility as our savings accounts for everyday banking needs. Notably, these investment accounts do not accrue interest and are not protected under the Deposit Insurance Scheme, which is managed by the Singapore Deposit Insurance Corporation (SDIC), unlike our savings accounts.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ed92e41d\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps can I take to confirm that an email claiming to be from Horizon Bank is authentic?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank will only send messages from an address that finishes with @horizonbank.sg.  \\n- We will never request your password, PIN, or any confidential account details via email.  \\n- If you are unsure about a message, reach out to our Customer Care team at +{{faq_ed92e41d_001}} {{faq_ed92e41d_002}}- HORIZ ( +{{faq_ed92e41d_003}} {{faq_ed92e41d_004}} {{faq_ed92e41d_005}} ) or connect with us through the in‑app chat or a phone call.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"funding, SGD deduction, currency conversion, paymen