{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T10:57:24.357+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_74c3c0f2-4d6d-454a-a770-66d1addeded7", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently. A parent is sufficient only if it directly supports that task.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): How do I set up recurring automatic investments in individual stocks, what are the eligibility requirements, and how will the purchases be funded?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nTo open a savings account, applicants must be Singapore residents applying locally. The process requires a mobile device for MyInfo verification. Reinstalling the Horizon App after registration necessitates SingPass authentication for subsequent logins.\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back. Last time, I provided the FAQ details regarding the requirements for opening a savings account and using the Horizon App. Would you like to discuss those topics further or ask about something else?\nUser: How do I set up recurring automatic investments in individual stocks, what are the eligibility requirements, and how will the purchases be funded?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"verify, qualification, check requirements, account opening, onboarding\", \"policy\": \"age limit, residency status, account ownership, eligibility criteria, investment account requirements\", \"conceptual\": \"investor eligibility, trading account requirements, stock account qualification\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"General Inquiries\", \"Fees And Charges\"], \"customer_component\": \"what are the eligibility requirements\"}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_b6934e37\", \"content\": \"Question: Are investments with Horizon Bank limited to cash transactions, or can I utilize my CPF or SRS account?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, our investment platform currently only accommodates cash transactions for trading stocks and ETFs. Unfortunately, this means that funds from CPF or SRS accounts are not eligible for use in these investment activities at this time.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_41bb5359\", \"content\": \"Question: How do investment accounts at Horizon Bank differ from traditional savings accounts in terms of their usage and benefits?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, our investment accounts are specifically designed for trading stocks and ETFs, and they do not offer the same flexibility as our savings accounts for everyday banking needs. Notably, these investment accounts do not accrue interest and are not protected under the Deposit Insurance Scheme, which is managed by the Singapore Deposit Insurance Corporation (SDIC), unlike our savings accounts.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2aed0ebe\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank safeguard my investment funds?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we ensure the security of your investments by holding them through our designated custodian, strictly adhering to the regulatory requirements outlined in the Securities and Futures Act.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2fe9ef88\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm experiencing difficulties with the Horizon Bank mobile application. How can I obtain technical assistance?\\n\\nAnswer: To resolve the issue, you can reach out to our dedicated support team through the in-app messaging feature or by dialing +{{faq_2fe9ef88_001}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_002}}-HORIZON (+{{faq_2fe9ef88_003}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_004}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_005}}) for personalized guidance.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"