ation, deposit account prerequisites\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Stocks\", \"Deposit_Account\"], \"target_intent\": [\"General Inquiries\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"Eligibility\"], \"customer_component\": \"what are the eligibility requirements\"}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_10f9fec0\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the requirements to open a new Horizon Bank account?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate the application process for a Horizon Bank account, simply utilize your mobile device and authenticate through MyInfo, which will expedite the pre-filling of your application in a secure manner. For non-Singaporean residents, please be prepared to upload a valid passport and relevant income documentation, particularly if you are applying for a Horizon credit card.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_41bb5359\", \"content\": \"Question: How do investment accounts at Horizon Bank differ from traditional savings accounts in terms of their usage and benefits?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, our investment accounts are specifically designed for trading stocks and ETFs, and they do not offer the same flexibility as our savings accounts for everyday banking needs. Notably, these investment accounts do not accrue interest and are not protected under the Deposit Insurance Scheme, which is managed by the Singapore Deposit Insurance Corporation (SDIC), unlike our savings accounts.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b6934e37\", \"content\": \"Question: Are investments with Horizon Bank limited to cash transactions, or can I utilize my CPF or SRS account?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, our investment platform currently only accommodates cash transactions for trading stocks and ETFs. Unfortunately, this means that funds from CPF or SRS accounts are not eligible for use in these investment activities at this time.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_d18f8450\", \"content\": \"Question: As an existing customer of another bank, am I eligible for a Horizon Bank account by default?\\n\\nAnswer: Having an account with another institution does not automatically qualify you for a Horizon Bank account. However, you can easily register for a Horizon Bank account through the Horizon App in a matter of minutes, allowing you to start benefiting from discounts on your daily expenses right away.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"deduct, transfer, fund, payment processing, automatic deduction, settlement, recurring investment setup\", \"policy\": \"currency conversion, funding source, settlement timing, account linkage, recurring payment authorization\", \"conceptual\": \"funding mechanism, SGD deduction, USD conversion, recurring investment funding, automated transfer\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Stocks\", \"Deposit_Account\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Payments And Transfers\"], \"customer_component\": \"how will the purchases be funded\"}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_b73dbebe\", \"content\": \"Question: Does Horizon Bank offer personalized investment guidance to its clients?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank maintains a neutral stance and does not extend investment advice to its customers, allowing them to make independent decisions regarding their financial portfolios.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b8e22edc\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank's fee structure work for investment transactions?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we provide a competitive fee environment for our investors. Until December {{faq_b8e22edc_001}}, {{faq_b8e22edc_002}}, trading US stocks and ETFs is commission-free. After this period, a commission of {{faq_b8e22edc_003}} applies, with a minimum charge of USD {{faq_b8e22edc_004}} per trade. For UK UCITS ETFs, a commission rate of {{faq_b8e22edc_005}} is applicable, with a minimum fee of USD {{faq_b8e22edc_006}} per trade. Additionally, a {{faq_b8e22edc_007}} GST is levied on commissions, and your Trade Confirmation will also serve as your Tax Invoic