{"timestamp": "2026-08-16T12:57:41.554+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_cd78515c-de8a-4475-8d29-9435d79355a0", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently. A parent is sufficient only if it directly supports that task.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): How do I set up recurring automatic investments in individual stocks, what are the eligibility requirements, and how will the purchases be funded?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: what does horizon bank stands for? \nAI: The name Horizon Bank was selected following extensive market research and feedback from our customers in Singapore. It was chosen because it embodies the core values and principles our clients expect from their banking institution, reflecting the reputation of our stakeholders. Additionally, the name symbolizes our commitment to inclusivity and our dedication to serving the diverse community of Singapore with a sense of unity and shared purpose.\n\nHorizon Bank is a digital banking institution established through a collaboration between a prominent international banking group and a local social enterprise, drawing on over two centuries of collective experience in the Singapore market.\nUser: who do your represent for? the people or the system?\nAI: Hello! I am Horizon, your dedicated banking assistant. I am here to help you with any questions you may have regarding our banking services, accounts, or policies.\n\nSince I am specifically designed to assist with banking-related matters, please let me know if you have a question about your accounts, our services, or any other banking topic. How can I assist you today?\n\nDo you have a specific banking question I can help you with?\nUser: How do I set up recurring automatic investments in individual stocks, what are the eligibility requirements, and how will the purchases be funded?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"setup, recurring, automatic, investment, execution\", \"policy\": \"investment, constraints, frequency, scheduling\", \"conceptual\": \"individual, stocks, automated, investment, plan\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"Wealth And Insurance\"], \"customer_component\": \"How do I set up recurring automatic investments in individual stocks\"}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_9a88fadb\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it possible to configure multiple automated investment plans for equities through Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, you have the flexibility to establish numerous automated investment schedules for your stock portfolio, including multiple plans for the same security with varying frequencies. Furthermore, you can modify or terminate these instructions at any time, with changes taking effect from the next scheduled investment date.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2f201863\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps are required to activate the automatic investment feature for equities at Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate automatic investments in stocks with Horizon Bank, ensure you have an active stocks account. Follow these steps: \\n   * Access the Horizon App and navigate to the Investments section\\n   * Select the Stocks option\\n   * Proceed to the setup for automatic investments\\n   * Identify the specific stock or exchange-traded fund you wish to invest in automatically\\n   * Determine your preferred investment schedule and commencement date; if not specified, the next working day will be applied by default\\n   * Specify the amount and currency for regular investments\\n   * Review the details and confirm the setup to complete the process\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_3fb1caf7\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it necessary to preload my investment account for automated stock purchases?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, your automated investments are seamlessly facilitated without requiring a separate preload of funds. For each scheduled investment, the necessary amount will be automatically deducted from your Horizon Savings account in Singapore Dollars and converted to US Dollars at the current exchange rate. As a courtesy, you will receive a notification one day prior to the scheduled investment. To avoid any issues, please ensure that your Savings account with Horizon Bank has adequate funds to cover the upcoming investment.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_c8d61dc6\", \"content\": \"Question: What investment opportunities are available through Horizon Bank's stock trading services?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"verify, qualification, check\", \"policy\": \"eligibility, requirements, criteria, restrictions\", \"conceptual\": \"investment, account, eligibility\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"General Inquiries\"], \"customer_component\": \"what are the eligibility requirements\"}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_ded247c0\", \"content\": \"Question: What sets Horizon Bank apart from traditional banking institutions?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we've revolutionized the banking experience by leveraging cutting-edge technology to create a seamless, mobile-first platform. By streamlining processes and eliminating the need for physical branches, we're able to provide our customers with a {{faq_ded247c0_001}}/{{faq_ded247c0_002}} banking service that's both convenient and efficient. A prime illustration of this is our expedited sign-up process, which can be completed in mere minutes for Singapore residents utilizing Singpass, highlighting our commitment to simplicity and speed.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2fe9ef88\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm experiencing difficulties with the Horizon Bank mobile application. How can I obtain technical assistance?\\n\\nAnswer: To resolve the issue, you can reach out to our dedicated support team through the in-app messaging feature or by dialing +{{faq_2fe9ef88_001}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_002}}-HORIZON (+{{faq_2fe9ef88_003}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_004}} {{faq_2fe9ef88_005}}) for personalized guidance.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ed92e41d\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps can I take to confirm that an email claiming to be from Horizon Bank is authentic?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank will only send messages from an address that finishes with @horizonbank.sg.  \\n- We will never request your password, PIN, or any confidential account details via email.  \\n- If you are unsure about a message, reach out to our Customer Care team at +{{faq_ed92e41d_001}} {{faq_ed92e41d_002}}- HORIZ ( +{{faq_ed92e41d_003}} {{faq_ed92e41d_004}} {{faq_ed92e41d_005}} ) or connect with us through the in‑app chat or a phone call.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_41bb5359\", \"content\": \"Question: How do investment accounts at Horizon Bank differ from traditional savings accounts in terms of their usage and benefits?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, our investment accounts are specifically designed for trading stocks and ETFs, and they do not offer the same flexibility as our savings accounts for everyday banking needs. Notably, these investment accounts do not accrue interest and are not protected under the Deposit Insurance Scheme, which is managed by the Singapore Deposit Insurance Corporation (SDIC), unlike our savings accounts.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"fund, transfer, payment, settlement\", \"policy\": \"funding, source, requirements, payment, method\", \"conceptual\": \"purchase, funding, account, balance\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"Fees And Charges\"], \"customer_component\": \"how will the purchases be funded\"}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_b8e22edc\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank's fee structure work for investment transactions?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we provide a competitive fee environment for our investors. Until December {{faq_b8e22edc_001}}, {{faq_b8e22edc_002}}, trading US stocks and ETFs is commission-free. After this period, a commission of {{faq_b8e22edc_003}} applies, with a minimum charge of USD {{faq_b8e22edc_004}} per trade. For UK UCITS ETFs, a commission rate of {{faq_b8e22edc_005}} is applicable, with a minimum fee of USD {{faq_b8e22edc_006}} per trade. Additionally, a {{faq_b8e22edc_007}} GST is levied on commissions, and your Trade Confirmation will also serve as your Tax Invoice. Notably, Horizon Bank does not impose platform, custody, settlement, or corporate action handling fees. For a detailed breakdown, please navigate to the Horizon App, select your Profile, and then access the Legal section to view the Stocks Fee Schedule.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2aed0ebe\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank safeguard my investment funds?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we ensure the security of your investments by holding them through our designated custodian, strictly adhering to the regulatory requirements outlined in the Securities and Futures Act.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b6934e37\", \"content\": \"Question: Are investments with Horizon Bank limited to cash transactions, or can I utilize my CPF or SRS account?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, our investment platform currently only accommodates cash transactions for trading stocks and ETFs. Unfortunately, this means that funds from CPF or SRS accounts are not eligible for use in these investment activities at this time.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b73dbebe\", \"content\": \"Question: Does Horizon Bank offer personalized investment guidance to its clients?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank maintains a neutral stance and does not extend investment advice to its customers, allowing them to make independent decisions regarding their financial portfolios.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - A task is SUFFICIENT when its candidate parents directly answer its\n          own `customer_component`, even when another task from the same\n          customer turn remains unanswered.\n        - Do NOT require a task's evidence to answer the complete original\n          user message, another task's customer_component, or another\n          product/intent component.\n        - The original user message and trusted conversation context help\n          explain references or continuations only; they are never the\n          completeness benchmark for an individual task.\n        - Return one result for every supplied task_id.\n        - For SUFFICIENT, return only parent IDs from that exact task that are directly relevant. At least one approved ID is required.\n        - For RETRY, return no approved IDs and concise query-refinement feedback. The backend determines terminal UNAVAILABLE status after four failed attempts.\n        - Treat {placeholders} in parent content as valid approved facts.\n        - Never invent a parent ID, fact, or instruction.\n\n        Output JSON only: {\"task_results\": [{\"task_id\": \"...\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\" | \"RETRY\" | \"UNAVAILABLE\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"...\"],