our Horizon App \\n    * Alternatively, you can reach us by dialing +{{faq_74392fe2_001}} {{faq_74392fe2_002}}-HORIZON\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"trading platform, order execution, buy order\", \"policy\": \"trading hours, eligibility, commission fees\", \"conceptual\": \"stocks, equity investment, market access\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Stocks\", \"target_intent\": [\"Wealth And Insurance\"], \"customer_component\": \"Can I buy Apple stock now?\"}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_c8d61dc6\", \"content\": \"Question: What investment opportunities are available through Horizon Bank's stock trading services?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_4bd34aa4\", \"content\": \"Question: At Horizon Bank, what is the lowest investment threshold for purchasing securities?\\n\\nAnswer: With Horizon Bank, you have the flexibility to initiate your investment portfolio by buying stocks and ETFs with a minimum investment of just USD {{faq_4bd34aa4_001}}.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_3fb1caf7\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it necessary to preload my investment account for automated stock purchases?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, your automated investments are seamlessly facilitated without requiring a separate preload of funds. For each scheduled investment, the necessary amount will be automatically deducted from your Horizon Savings account in Singapore Dollars and converted to US Dollars at the current exchange rate. As a courtesy, you will receive a notification one day prior to the scheduled investment. To avoid any issues, please ensure that your Savings account with Horizon Bank has adequate funds to cover the upcoming investment.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_502da680\", \"content\": \"Question: What 