ained the FAQ steps for securing a lost credit card and ordering a replacement through the Horizon App. Would you like to continue that discussion or ask about something else?\nCustomer: have you watched stargate? i lost my credit card. Can i give some advice as if apple stock is good to buy?\nHorizon Bot: Log into the Horizon App and navigate to the card overview screen to select \"View & Manage Card.\"\n\nSelect \"Freeze Card\" to secure your account, then tap \"Order Replacement\" to initiate the issuance of a new card.\n\nOnce you request a replacement, Horizon will permanently deactivate your old card. Please note that your new card will arrive with a different card number, so remember to update any recurring payments or subscriptions. You may also wish to file a police report for a lost or stolen card. For further assistance, you can select \"Contact Us\" from the app menu.\n\nI cannot assist with your question regarding Stargate, as that topic is outside what a banking assistant can help with. Regarding your request for investment advice on Apple stock, I am unable to help with that specific request; I suggest speaking with a financial advisor for that kind of need.\nCustomer: can you give me some stock advice?\nHorizon Bot: Sorry, for your request, I can't provide an answer — it requires guidance a licensed advisor should give.\nCustomer: can you watch stargate with me?\nHorizon Bot: Hello! I am Horizon, your banking assistant. I am here to help you with questions regarding our banking services. Could you please clarify your banking-related request so I can better assist you?\n\nCould you please provide more details about your banking question?\nCustomer: i need to talk to a human\nHorizon Bot: I am transferring you to a human agent.\n\n        \"\"\"\n        \n        Output JSON only: {\"summary\": \"concise high-density summary\"}.\n        Do not include an introduction or chat markers in the summary value.\n        \n"}
