tion for a Horizon credit card. Where can I view the complete details of my Horizon account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Install the Horizon App on your device and sign in using MyInfo. Ensure your MyInfo profile is fully set up for a seamless first login.\\n- After logging in, the Horizon App provides full control over your credit card, allowing you to:\\n  - Review card information such as number, expiration date, and CVV\\n  - Activate the newly issued physical card\\n  - Lock or unlock the card as needed\\n  - Add the card to Apple Wallet\\n  - Request a change to your credit limit\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_9766054e\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it possible to avoid installing the Horizon App?\\n\\nAnswer: - No. Installing the Horizon App is required to activate your Horizon credit card and to manage your account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ed9b5ce2\", \"content\": \"Question: What measures does Horizon Bank take to protect me from phishing scams and unauthorized transactions?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we prioritize your security and adhere to the guidelines outlined in Section {{faq_ed9b5ce2_001}} of the E-Payments User Protection Guidelines. As part of our commitment to the Shared Responsibility Framework, we have implemented several key measures to safeguard your accounts. These include: \\n   - A mandatory {{faq_ed9b5ce2_002}}-hour waiting period after activating your Horizon Key or logging in from a new device, during which certain high-risk activities such as adding new payees, increasing transaction limits, disabling notifications, or changing your contact information are restricted.\\n   - Immediate notifications: You will receive instant updates via push notifications and email for all outgoing payments, ensuring you are always informed about your transactions.\\n   - Emergency Lockdown: The Horizon App features an Emergency Lockdown option, accessible under Profile > Security, which allows you to instantly block all access to your mobile banking, account, and cards if you suspect they have been compromised.\\n   - Advanced Security Systems: As of {{faq_ed9b5ce2_003}} June {{faq_ed9b5ce2_004}}, we have enhanced our systems to provide an additional layer of protection against potential phishing scams. Some transactions may be temporarily paused for review, and you will be notified to verify the transaction. If you do not recognize the transaction, please cancel it within the {{faq_ed9b5ce2_005}}-hour timeframe provided.\\n   - Round-the-Clock Support: Our customer service is available {{faq_ed9b5ce2_006}}/{{faq_ed9b5ce2_007}}. You can reach us through the Horizon App or by calling our dedicated hotline at +{{faq_ed9b5ce2_008}} {{faq_ed9b5ce2_009}} {{faq_ed9b5ce2_010}} for immediate assistance.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that tas