,000 if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\nUser: i lost my card, how do i apply loan in app, where's your physical branch that i can visit?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"apply, submit, navigate, app\", \"policy\": \"eligibility criteria, income requirements, terms\", \"conceptual\": \"personal loan, instant loan, application process\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Application\", \"Eligibility\"], \"customer_component\": \"How do I apply for a loan in the app?\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"apply, submit, navigate, app\", \"policy\": \"eligibility criteria, income requirements, terms\", \"conceptual\": \"personal loan, instant loan, application process\"}]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_0ae0bb51\", \"content\": \"Question: Do I qualify for Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan offering?\\n\\nAnswer: - **For current Horizon Bank clients:**\\n  * You need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit.\\n- **For new applicants:**\\n  * Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan.\\n  * Every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment.\\n\\nYou may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\\n- You are aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_46c17d0e\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps do I need to take to initiate a balance transfer request with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To begin the balance transfer process, navigate to the Horizon App, select the 'More' option, and then proceed to the 'Loan' sect