uirements\", \"conceptual\": \"loan application, mobile app\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Application\", \"Account Management\"], \"customer_component\": \"How do I apply for a loan in the Horizon app?\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"apply, navigate, submit\", \"policy\": \"eligibility, requirements\", \"conceptual\": \"loan application, mobile app\"}]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_f9cce3c1\", \"content\": \"Question: If my Instant Loan request is declined, can I still submit applications for other Horizon Bank products such as a credit card or a savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Absolutely. A declined loan does not prevent you from applying for other Horizon Bank offerings. You simply need to start a new application tailored to the specific product you wish to obtain.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_75ed6e4d\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical timeframe for my loan to be approved?\\n\\nAnswer: - The vast majority of loans are approved and the amount is deposited into your Horizon savings account in about {{faq_75ed6e4d_001}} seconds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_46c17d0e\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps do I need to take to initiate a balance transfer request with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To begin the balance transfer process, navigate to the Horizon App, select the 'More' option, and then proceed to the 'Loan' section, where you will find 'Other Flexible Loans' to commence your application.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_9470585b\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank protect my identity when I send payments, and what information is shared with the recipient?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we prioritize your privacy and security. When you receive payments through the Horizon App, your partial name is displayed to help prevent impersonation scams. However, as a sender, your full name will appear on the recipient's statement and transaction records. This standard practice across major payment schemes supports various business use cases, such as validating investment funds or resolving disputes. It also helps identify potential scams or fraud by allowing recipients to verify the source of funds. This measure is in place to ensure the integrity of transactions and provide an additional layer of security for our customers.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"visit, locate, find\", \"policy\": \"operating hours, location rules\", \"conceptual\": \"physical branch, ATM, experience centre\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Branch And ATM Locator\"], \"customer_component\": \"Where is the physical branch that I can visit?\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"visit, locate, find\", \"policy\": \"operating hours, location rules\", \"conceptual\": \"physical branch, ATM, experience centre\"}]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_768b41d9\", \"content\": \"Question: Where can I locate an ATM to take out cash?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank cardholders may withdraw funds from any Horizon‑branded or Standard Chartered (SCB) ATM throughout Singapore, as well as from Visa‑compatible ATMs overseas.\\n- Horizon‑branded machines are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_768b41d9_001}}‑{{faq_768b41d9_002}}.\\n- SCB ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre and Battery Road.\\n- A full list of locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"content\": \"Question: Where are the ATMs I can use to withdraw cash with my Horizon account?\\n\\nAnswer: - You may obtain cash at any Horizon‑branded ATM or at Standard Chartered Bank (SCB) ATMs that accept Visa, both within the country and overseas.\\n- Horizon‑b