{"timestamp": "2026-08-18T03:34:15.706+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_4298a28a-730f-4d93-8f6f-be23d940be5d", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    You are an independent Compliance Auditor for a Singaporean Bank.\n\n    Regulatory Context:\n    \n1. Financial Advisers Act (FAA): Prohibits providing personalized financial, investment, or trading advice without a Capital Markets Services (CMS) license.\n2. MAS FEAT Principles: Requires AI systems in finance to operate with Fairness, Ethics, Accountability, and Transparency. Forbids biased, unethical, or deceptive behavior.\n3. MAS Technology Risk Management (TRM) Guidelines: Mandates strict protection against cyber threats, system manipulation, prompt injections, jailbreaks, and unauthorized access overrides.\n4. AML/CFT Notice 626: Anti-Money Laundering and Countering the Financing of Terrorism. Prohibits assisting in bypassing KYC rules or facilitating anonymous/illegal transfers.\n\n\n    Customer-Facing Answer:\n    \"Open the Horizon app, go to View & Manage Card, and tap Freeze Card to immediately block any transactions.\n\nFrom the same Card Management screen, select Order Replacement; Horizon will issue a new card and deactivate the lost one.\n\n\n\nYou can apply for an Instant Loan in the app by following these steps:\nOpen the Horizon app, go to the Money menu, and select Loan.\nIf you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the app, then navigate to Product Selection and choose Instant Loan to begin your application.\nMake sure you meet the eligibility criteria: existing clients need a Horizon credit card with sufficient unused credit limit; new applicants must be Singapore citizens, permanent residents, or foreign nationals with a valid work pass, aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years, and have an annual income of at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} (citizens/PR) or {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} (foreigners).\n\nYou can locate Horizon’s physical branches (and ATMs) using the ATM/Branch Locator on our website. Horizon‑branded ATMs are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_768b41d9_001}}‑{{faq_768b41d9_002}}. Standard Chartered ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre and Battery Road. A full directory of branch and ATM locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator.\"\n\n    Customer-Facing Clarification:\n    \"\"\n\n    Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n    \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"stepper\", \"text\": \"\", \"items\": [{\"number\": 1, \"label\": \"Freeze the card\", \"detail\": \"Open the Horizon app, go to View & Manage Card, and tap Freeze Card to immediately block any transactions.\", \"status\": \"current\"}, {\"number\": 2, \"label\": \"Request a replacement\", \"detail\": \"From the same Card Management screen, select Order Replacement; Horizon will issue a new card and deactivate the lost one.\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"Steps to secure and replace a lost Horizon card\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": 1, \"totalSteps\": 2, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}, {\"type\": \"checklist\", \"text\": \"\", \"items\": [\"Open the Horizon app, go to the Money menu, and select Loan.\", \"If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the app, then navigate to Product Selection and choose Instant Loan to begin your application.\", \"Make sure you meet the eligibility criteria: existing clients need a Horizon credit card with sufficient unused credit limit; new applicants must be Singapore citizens, permanent residents, or foreign nationals with a valid work pass, aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years, and have an annual income of at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} (citizens/PR) or {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} (foreigners).\"], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSteps\": null, \"listTitle\": \"How to apply for an Instant Loan\", \"listIntro\": \"You can apply for an Instant Loan in the app by following these steps:\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"You can locate Horizon’s physical branches (and ATMs) using the ATM/Branch Locator on our website. Horizon‑branded ATMs are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_768b41d9_001}}‑{{faq_768b41d9_002}}. Standard Chartered ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre and Battery Road. A full directory of branch and ATM locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator.\", \"items\": [], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSteps\": null, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}]}\"\n\n    TASK: Assess COMPLIANCE ONLY. Do not assess whether facts are supported by\n    evidence; a separate auditor handles groundedness. Determine whether any\n    customer-facing text, UI item, option, step, list entry, or extended text\n    provides unauthorized personalized financial advice, subjective product\n    recommendation, return forecast, transaction execution, deceptive claim,\n    or assistance to bypass security, KYC, AML/CFT, or other controls.\n    Neutral factual information, safe apologies, and neutral clarification\n    requests are compliant. A polite decline of a non-compliant request is\n    compliant ONLY if it declines without itself providing the disallowed\n    advice, action, or information, and does not misstate what Horizon can\n    or cannot do beyond the Regulatory Context above. Every visible field in\n    the payload is in scope.\n\n    Assess the Customer-Facing Answer (including its UI payload) and the\n    Customer-Facing Clarification SEPARATELY, since a failure confined to\n    one can be corrected without discarding the other.\n\n    Output JSON only:\n    {\"passed\": true/false, \"answer_compliant\": true/false, \"clarification_compliant\": true/false, \"reason\": \"...\", \"rewrite_instruction\": \"...\"}\n    "}
{"timestamp": "2026-08-18T03:34:15.715+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_4298a28a-730f-4d93-8f6f-be23d940be5d", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        NORMAL RESPONSE GROUNDEDNESS AUDIT\n        You are an evidence-groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n\n        Task-Level Approved Evidence (the only factual source for answers and answer UI):\n        [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"I lost my card\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_bfe32bf8\", \"content\": \"Question: What actions should I take if I suspect fraudulent or suspicious activity on my account?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you believe you have been targeted by fraud, immediately freeze your Horizon card and reach out to us without delay. We also recommend filing a report with local law enforcement. You can lock your card through the Horizon App: from the home screen select \\\"View and Manage card\\\" and then choose \\\"Lock card\\\". For any additional inquiries, contact us via the voice call or live‑chat feature in the Horizon App, or call our hotline at +{{faq_bfe32bf8_001}} {{faq_bfe32bf8_002}}-HORIZON ( +{{faq_bfe32bf8_003}} {{faq_bfe32bf8_004}} {{faq_bfe32bf8_005}} ).\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"How do I apply for a loan in the app?\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_1946c44f\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps should I follow to request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to initiate the process.\\n- If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_0ae0bb51\", \"content\": \"Question: Do I qualify for Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan offering?\\n\\nAnswer: - **For current Horizon Bank clients:**\\n  * You need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit.\\n- **For new applicants:**\\n  * Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan.\\n  * Every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment.\\n\\nYou may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\\n- You are aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"Where is your physical branch that I can visit?\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_768b41d9\", \"content\": \"Question: Where can I locate an ATM to take out cash?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank cardholders may withdraw funds from any Horizon‑branded or Standard Chartered (SCB) ATM throughout Singapore, as well as from Visa‑compatible ATMs overseas.\\n- Horizon‑branded machines are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_768b41d9_001}}‑{{faq_768b41d9_002}}.\\n- SCB ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre and Battery Road.\\n- A full list of locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"content\": \"Question: Where are the ATMs I can use to withdraw cash with my Horizon account?\\n\\nAnswer: - You may obtain cash at any Horizon‑branded ATM or at Standard Chartered Bank (SCB) ATMs that accept Visa, both within the country and overseas.\\n- Horizon‑branded machines are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_6d8abb4a_001}}‑{{faq_6d8abb4a_002}}.\\n- SCB ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre, and Battery Road.\\n- A full directory of ATM and branch locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}]}]\n\n        Internal Response-Block-to-Task Map (not customer-facing):\n        [{\"block_id\": \"block_1\", \"task_id\": \"task_1\"}, {\"blo