{"timestamp": "2026-08-18T03:49:33.087+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_4298a28a-730f-4d93-8f6f-be23d940be5d", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        NORMAL RESPONSE GROUNDEDNESS AUDIT\n        You are an evidence-groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n\n        Task-Level Approved Evidence (the only factual source for answers and answer UI):\n        [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"I lost my card, how do I report it or request a replacement?\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"How do I apply for a loan in the mobile app?\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_1946c44f\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps should I follow to request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to initiate the process.\\n- If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_0ae0bb51\", \"content\": \"Question: Do I qualify for Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan offering?\\n\\nAnswer: - **For current Horizon Bank clients:**\\n  * You need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit.\\n- **For new applicants:**\\n  * Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan.\\n  * Every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment.\\n\\nYou may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\\n- You are aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"Where is your physical branch that I can visit?\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_768b41d9\", \"content\": \"Question: Where can I locate an ATM to take out cash?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank cardholders may withdraw funds from any Horizon‑branded or Standard Chartered (SCB) ATM throughout Singapore, as well as from Visa‑compatible ATMs overseas.\\n- Horizon‑branded machines are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_768b41d9_001}}‑{{faq_768b41d9_002}}.\\n- SCB ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre and Battery Road.\\n- A full list of locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"content\": \"Question: Where are the ATMs I can use to withdraw cash with my Horizon account?\\n\\nAnswer: - You may obtain cash at any Horizon‑branded ATM or at Standard Chartered Bank (SCB) ATMs that accept Visa, both within the country and overseas.\\n- Horizon‑branded machines are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_6d8abb4a_001}}‑{{faq_6d8abb4a_002}}.\\n- SCB ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre, and Battery Road.\\n- A full directory of ATM and branch locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}]}]\n\n        Internal Response-Block-to-Task Map (not customer-facing):\n        [{\"block_id\": \"block_1\", \"task_id\": \"task_1\"}, {\"block_id\": \"block_2\", \"task_id\": \"task_2\"}, {\"block_id\": \"block_3\", \"task_id\": \"task_3\"}]\n\n        Intent Clarification Inputs (the only source for intent clarification):\n        []\n\n        Terminal Retrieval Clarification Evidence (permitted only for factual related-topic suggestions in terminal clarification):\n        []\n\n        Decline Inputs (the only source for a declined-topic explanation):\n        []\n\n        Customer-Facing Answer:\n        \"Sure, here’s how to handle your lost card, apply for a loan, and find a nearby Horizon branch.\n\nSign in, tap the card overview screen, then select “View & Manage Card.”\n\nTap “Freeze Card” to immediately block transactions.\n\nAfter freezing, choose “Order Replacement” to request a new card; the old card will be deactivated.\n\n\n\nIn the Horizon App, tap the Money menu and select Loan to start.\n\nMake sure you meet age ({{faq_0ae0bb51_001}}‑{{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years) and income requirements ({{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} for Singapore citizens/PRs, {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} for foreigners) and have an unused credit limit if you’re an existing client.\n\nFollow the on‑screen prompts to complete and submit the loan request.\n\n\n\nYou can visit any Horizon‑branded or Standard Chartered ATM/branch. Horizon‑branded machines are located at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_768b41d9_001}}‑{{faq_768b41d9_002}}. SCB ATMs (which also serve Horizon cards) are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre and Battery Road. A full directory of branches and ATMs is accessible via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"\n\n        Customer-Facing Clarification:\n        \"\"\n\n        Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n        \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Sure, here’s how to handle your lost card, apply for a loan, and find a nearby Horizon branch.\"}, {\"type\": \"stepper\", \"text\": \"\", \"items\": [{\"number\": 1, \"label\": \"Open the app and go to Card Management\", \"detail\": \"Sign in, tap the card overview screen, then select “View & Manage Card.”\", \"status\": \"current\"}, {\"number\": 2, \"label\": \"Freeze the missing card\", \"detail\": \"Tap “Freeze Card” to immediately block transactions.\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}, {\"number\": 3, \"label\": \"Order a replacement\", \"detail\": \"After freezing, choose “Ord