{"timestamp": "2026-08-18T03:57:18.832+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_4298a28a-730f-4d93-8f6f-be23d940be5d", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    USER JOURNEY V2.0 PRESENTATION PLANNER\n    You are designing the presentation for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ response.\n    Decide the user experience only after reviewing task-level approved evidence.\n\n    User request: i lost my card, how do i apply loan in app, where's your physical branch that i can visit?\n    Task results: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\", \"reason\": \"Parent faq_7883a8c2 directly addresses how to handle a lost card and freeze/replace it in the app.\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\", \"reason\": \"faq_1946c44f directly explains how to apply for a loan in the Horizon App by navigating t