{"timestamp": "2026-08-18T03:57:25.268+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_4298a28a-730f-4d93-8f6f-be23d940be5d", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    You are an independent Compliance Auditor for a Singaporean Bank.\n\n    Regulatory Context:\n    \n1. Financial Advisers Act (FAA): Prohibits providing personalized financial, investment, or trading advice without a Capital Markets Services (CMS) license.\n2. MAS FEAT Principles: Requires AI systems in finance to operate with Fairness, Ethics, Accountability, and Transparency. Forbids biased, unethical, or deceptive behavior.\n3. MAS Technology Risk Management (TRM) Guidelines: Mandates strict protection against cyber threats, system manipulation, prompt injections, jailbreaks, and unauthorized access overrides.\n4. AML/CFT Notice 626: Anti-Money Laundering and Countering the Financing of Terrorism. Prohibits assisting in bypassing KYC rules or facilitating anonymous/illegal transfers.\n\n\n    Customer-Facing Answer:\n    \"I can help with each of your requests.\n\nOpen the Horizon App, go to the card overview, tap “View & Manage Card” and select “Freeze Card” to temporarily disable it.\n\nAfter freezing, stay on the same screen, tap “Order Replacement” to request a new card; the old card will be permanently deactivated and the new one will be mailed.\n\nYou may also wish to file a police report. For additional assistance, select “Contact Us” from the app menu.\n\nTo request an Instant Loan, open the Horizon App, go to the Money menu, and select Loan. If you’re not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to Product Selection and choose Instant Loan to begin your application.\n\nOur Horizon Experience Centre is located inside FairPrice Xtra in VivoCity at #B{{faq_1e61de43_001}}-{{faq_1e61de43_002}}. Representatives can help you navigate the app and answer general queries. The centre is open daily from {{faq_1e61de43_005}}am to {{faq_1e61de43_006}}pm, with reduced hours on Christmas Eve, New Year's Eve, and Chinese New Year's Eve from {{faq_1e61de43_007}}am to {{faq_1e61de43_008}}pm. It is closed on Christmas Day, New Year's Day, and Chinese New Year public holidays. For account‑specific assistance, use the in‑app chat or call +{{faq_1e61de43_003}} {{faq_1e61de43_004}}-HORIZON.\n\nLet me know if you need anything else.\"\n\n    Customer-Facing Clarification:\n    \"\"\n\n    Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n    \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"I can help with each of your requests.\"}, {\"type\": \"stepper\", \"text\": \"\", \"items\": [{\"number\": 1, \"label\": \"Freeze the card\", \"detail\": \"Open the Horizon App, go to the card overview, tap “View & Manage Card” and select “Freeze Card” to temporarily disable it.\", \"status\": \"current\"}, {\"number\": 2, \"label\": \"Order a replacement\", \"detail\": \"After freezing, stay on the same screen, tap “Order Replacement” to request a new card; the old card will be permanently deactivated and the new one will be mailed.\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"Replace your lost Horizon card\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": 1, \"totalSteps\": 2, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"You may also wish to file a police report. For additional assistance, select “Contact Us” from the app menu.\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"To request an Instant Loan, open the Horizon App, go to the Money menu, and select Loan. If you’re not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to Product Selection and choose Instant Loan to begin your application.\", \"items\": [], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSte